// 1.0.8-29 · 按「设置页重构 v14」思路图实施（用户已确认全部四点）。
//   ① **框外染色退回**：删掉 1.0.8-28 的全屏 `_qaOutsideTint`，**「背景色值」只控制框内**。
//      框外回到「实时桌面 + 黑压暗」，不再带色；色相与透明度全部只作用在卡片玻璃上。
//   ② **「背景色」行重做为 8 段纯文字选择**（灰红/灰橙/灰黄/灰绿/灰青/灰蓝/灰紫/自定义）：
//      `PSRadioCell` 的竖排单选 → `ERSegmentedCell` 的分段控件（就是「小窗位置」用的那个），
//      **去掉左侧文字/图标**（8 段要铺满整行），**不画色块、只显示文字**。
//      存储仍是 `QuickAdd.BackgroundColor` 那一串 RGB —— 走新加的"色值模式"（erSegmentValues）：
//      读 = 串在表里反查下标（查不到 → 第 8 段「自定义」），写 = 表[下标] 写回同一个 key。
//      **Tweak 侧一行未改**：读的键、格式、语义都跟以前完全一样。
//   ③ **删掉单独的「自定义背景色 (R,G,B)」输入行**（PSEditTextCell，要用户手打 "38,45,58"）：
//      改由第 8 段「自定义」承担 —— 点它弹 RGB 小窗（R/G/B 三条 0–255 + 实时预览），
//      **透明度不在小窗里**，统一由上面那条「背景色值」滑块管。确定后把新 RGB 串写回同一 key。
//   ④ 色板的「灰蓝」= **38,45,58**（用户更正了此前的手误 38,45,48），与线上既有默认一致。
// 注：框内材质保持 1.0.8-28 的 A-1（v19 CSS）不变：模糊 4 / 框内压暗 0 / 行面白 0.06 /
//     行边光 0.08 / 选中行 #0A84FF + 光晕。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.8-28 · 按 v24 思路图实施（用户确认：材质取 A-1 = 严格按 v19 CSS）+ 背景色统一。
//   ① **可视行数 5 → 自适应**：屏高 ≥ 800pt 显示 **6 行**，否则回落 5 行
//      （`ERQuickAddVisibleRows`）。刘海/灵动岛机型（812 起）全部 6 行，
//      只有 4.7"/5.5" 那一代（667 / 736）回落 5 行。
//      卡片高 = 22 + 行数×64 + 16 + 50 + 20（行距 64 = cell 55 + 上下各 4.5，**行距已计入**）；
//      6 行时 492（原 428，+64），列表高 320 → 384，按钮卡内 y 358 → 422。
//   ② **标题 + 卡片 整体垂直居中**：整块高 = 标题 38 + 7 + 副标题 24 + 22 + 卡片，
//      6 行 583 / 5 行 519；顶边 = MAX(12, (屏高 − 整块高) ÷ 2)。
//      代码里原本就是这个公式，行数一变三处（卡片高 / 整块高 / 顶边）自动跟着变，
//      所以 5 行与 6 行**上留白都严格等于下留白**（932pt 屏：174.5；667pt 屏：74）。
//   ③ **框内材质回退到 v19 CSS（A-1）**：
//      · 框内模糊 30 → **4**（v19 `filter:blur(4px)`）
//      · 框内压暗 45 → **0**（v19 卡片只有 `.glass-dark`，没有压暗层）
//      · 行面白 0.02 → **0.06**；行边光 0.10 → **0.08**（v19 `.row` 原值）
//      · 选中行 #2E6BFF → **#0A84FF**，描边 rgba(80,160,255,0.9)，
//        并恢复 v19 的 `box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(10,132,255,0.55)`（CA shadowRadius 9 =
//        CSS 18px；CSS blur-radius 与 CA shadowRadius 约 1:2）。v19 那第二层
//        `0 0 4px rgba(120,180,255,0.8)` 因一个图层只能挂一个 shadow，
//        由 borderColor rgba(80,160,255,0.9) 承接同样的"边缘亮一圈"。
//   ④ **「背景色」改为同时作用于框内与框外**（用户要求「共同不分开」）：
//      新增全屏 `_qaOutsideTint`，用同一对参数 —— `QuickAdd.BackgroundColor`（色板/自定义 RGB）
//      + `QuickAdd.BackgroundAlpha`（「背景色值」滑块）。框内框外从此共用一套色；
//      亮度仍分开：「框外压暗」管框外、「框内压暗」管框内，两层都是黑的，只管亮度不管色相。
//      图层顺序：_qaBackdrop < _qaDim < _qaOutsideTint < 标题 < 卡片。
//      **【1.0.8-29 已按用户要求退回】—— 框外不再染色，_qaOutsideTint 整层删除。**
//   ⑤ 版本水印 `kERQuickAddPanelVersion` 同步。
//   注：1.0.8-27 那四项（框内压暗 45 / 模糊 30 / 行面白 0.02 / 删光晕）随 A-1 一并回退。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.8-27 ·「对照思路图把框内调回正轨」—— 用真机截图与思路图做像素级比对后定标。
//   方法：把 1.0.8-26 的实机截图与思路图裁到同一卡片框（350×428 r38 @ 卡 left40/top298），
//   逐区取中位数再反解参数。实测差距与对应改动：
//   ① 卡面色偏：真机 B−R = 8，思路图 B−R = 15~20 —— 真机偏"绿灰"、发闷。
//      → 背景色默认 38,45,48 → **38,45,58**（就是 v19 思路图 HTML 里写定的卡色）。
//   ② 卡面亮度：真机空档比思路图亮 3~4 灰阶，多出来的正是壁纸那 12% 的贡献。
//      → 框内压暗默认 30 → **45**。
//      合成校验：0.88×(38,45,58) + 0.12×0.55×桌面 ≈ (45,51,62)，与思路图卡面实测一致。
//   ③ 行面：真机行面比卡面高 **+11~13 灰阶**，整块卡看着像叠了几张白卡；
//      思路图只高 **+2~4**（pill 近乎隐形，靠 1px 边缘光 + 4.5pt 间距分行）。
//      → 行面白默认 0.05 → **0.02**（(255−46)×0.02 ≈ +4 灰阶）。
//   ④ 框内模糊：6pt 下楼体/路面轮廓仍可辨认，卡面呈"云雾状"结构；思路图是一片均匀的雾。
//      → 框内模糊默认 6 → **30**（滑块上限）。
//   ⑤ **选中行光晕：整个删掉**（v25 加的 shadowColor/Opacity 0.75/Radius 9 + 外扩 10pt
//      shadowPath 全部移除）。行距只有 4.5pt，9pt 的模糊半径直接把蓝色糊到上下相邻行；
//      本体 #2E6BFF + 阴影 #2E6BFF + 亮蓝描边三层蓝互压。思路图里这行是零发光的锐利实心蓝。
//   不动的东西：选中行色 #2E6BFF、行边光 0.10、卡片几何（350×428 r38）、行距 64/cell 55 r18、
//   按钮 147×50 r25、框外压暗 30、标题/副标题规格。按下即亮的交互保持不变。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.8-20：全部尺寸换到 v14（15PM 适配，v12 基准 ×1.097 取整）
static CGFloat const kERQACardWidth = 350.0;
static CGFloat const kERQACardCornerRadius = 38.0;
static CGFloat const kERQARowHeight = 64.0;      // 含上下各 4.5pt 间距，cell 本体 55pt
// 1.0.8-28 · 可视行数从「固定 5 行」改为按屏幕高度自适应。
//
// 屏高 ≥ 800pt 显示 6 行，否则回落 5 行。门槛取 800 的实际效果：
//   刘海 / 灵动岛机型（812 起：13/12 mini、14 Pro、15/15 Pro、15 Plus/Pro Max）→ 6 行
//   4.7" / 5.5" 那一代（iPhone SE 2/3、8、7、6 = 667；6/7/8 Plus = 736）→ 5 行
//
// 卡片高 = 上内距 22 + 行数×64 + 列表↔按钮 16 + 按钮 50 + 下内距 20（行距 64 = cell 55 + 上下各 4.5），
// 整块再按 (屏高 − 整块高) ÷ 2 居中 —— 行数一变，卡片高、整块高、顶边三处全部自动跟着变，
// 所以 5 行 / 6 行两种情况下上留白都严格等于下留白，不需要第二套坐标。
static NSInteger const kERQAVisibleRowsMax = 6;
static NSInteger const kERQAVisibleRowsMin = 5;
static CGFloat const kERQAVisibleRowsTallScreen = 800.0;

static NSInteger ERQuickAddVisibleRows(void) {
    CGFloat h = [UIScreen mainScreen].bounds.size.height;
    return (h >= kERQAVisibleRowsTallScreen) ? kERQAVisibleRowsMax : kERQAVisibleRowsMin;
}
static CGFloat const kERQACardInnerPadding = 44.0;   // 内容区横向总内距（左右各 22，列表与按钮同 span）
static CGFloat const kERQATitleHeight = 38.0;      // v24：32pt 标题
static CGFloat const kERQASubtitleHeight = 24.0;   // v24：18pt 副标题
static CGFloat const kERQAButtonHeight = 50.0;
static CGFloat const kERQAButtonCornerRadius = 25.0;
// v14 卡片纵向节奏：上 22 + 列表 320 + 间距 16 + 按钮 50 + 下 20 = 428
static CGFloat const kERQACardTopPad = 22.0;
static CGFloat const kERQACardBottomPad = 20.0;
static CGFloat const kERQATableButtonGap = 16.0;
static CGFloat const kERQAButtonGap = 12.0;
static CGFloat const kERQAButtonInset = 22.0;

// 面板内可见的版本水印（排查「设备到底跑的哪个版本」用；**每次发版与 control 同步**）
static NSString * const kERQuickAddPanelVersion = @"1.0.9-10";

// 1.0.8-19：自绘改名框的展示入口（定义在 sheet 控制器之后）
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.8-33 · 挑「主屏场景」，而不是随便挑第一个活跃场景。
//
// `[UIApplication connectedScenes]` 在 SpringBoard 里有好几个：主屏、
// 灵动岛、系统幕帘（SBSystemApertureCurtainWindowScene）……
// 原代码取**第一个**活跃/非活跃的场景，所以窗口到底建在哪一个是**随机的** ——
// 日志里就同时见过 SBSystemApertureWindowScene 与
// SBSystemApertureCurtainWindowScene。
//
// 把改名小窗建在幕帘 / 灵动岛场景上时，`makeKeyAndVisible` 照样成功、
// window 也是 key（`key=1`），但那个场景**不参与文本输入** —— 键盘永远不弹。
// 这正是「新建文件夹不弹键盘」的真因：改 level、重试 becomeFirstResponder
// 都无效，因为问题在场景不在层级。
//
// 修法：优先选宿主窗口里含 SBHomeScreenWindow 的场景（那才是 SpringBoard
// 真正的主场景）；找不到再退回第一个活跃场景（原行为，不至于更差）。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
static UIWindowScene *ERQuickAddMainScene(void) {
    UIWindowScene *fallback = nil;
    for (UIScene *candidate in [UIApplication sharedApplication].connectedScenes) {
        if (![candidate isKindOfClass:[UIWindowScene class]]) continue;
        if (candidate.activationState != UISceneActivationStateForegroundActive &&
            candidate.activationState != UISceneActivationStateForegroundInactive) continue;
        UIWindowScene *scene = (UIWindowScene *)candidate;
        if (!fallback) fallback = scene;
        for (UIWindow *window in scene.windows) {
            if ([NSStringFromClass(window.class) containsString:@"SBHomeScreenWindow"]) {
                return scene;
            }
        }
    }
    return fallback;
}

static void ERQuickAddPresentRenameDialog(void (^onConfirm)(NSString *name));

// 1.0.8-19：桌面快照（定义在改名框段之后，供 viewDidLoad 铺背景用）
static UIImage *ERQuickAddCaptureDesktopImage(void);

// 1.0.8-20：主动关闭图标 3D Touch 菜单（面板出现前调用）
static void ERQuickAddDismissContextMenu(id iconView);

// 1.0.8-23：即时隐藏 3D Touch 菜单视图（不等待系统淡出动画；随后自动恢复）
static void ERQuickAddHideMenuOverlays(void);

// 1.0.8-21：把快照图模糊化（CoreImage）——卡片/改名框的「自绘毛玻璃」用
static UIImage *ERQuickAddBlurredImage(UIImage *image, CGFloat radius);

#pragma mark - CoreGraphics 图标（白线性文件夹 + 彩色圆角底）

// 15 套底色，按 NSIndexPath.row 循环取用。
static NSArray<UIColor *> *ERQuickAddIconPalette(void) {
    static NSArray<UIColor *> *palette = nil;
    static dispatch_once_t once;
    dispatch_once(&once, ^{
        NSArray<NSString *> *hex = @[@"FF5F57", @"FF9F43", @"F5C518", @"34C759", @"30D5C8",
                                     @"0A84FF", @"5E5CE6", @"AF52DE", @"FF375F", @"FF69B4",
                                     @"FF7F50", @"98FB98", @"87CEEB", @"D8CFF0", @"8A9BBF"];
        NSMutableArray<UIColor *> *colors = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (NSString *hexValue in hex) {
            unsigned value = 0;
            sscanf(hexValue.UTF8String, "%06x", &value);
            [colors addObject:[UIColor colorWithRed:((value >> 16) & 0xFF) / 255.0
                                              green:((value >> 8) & 0xFF) / 255.0
                                               blue:(value & 0xFF) / 255.0
                                              alpha:1.0]];
        }
        palette = colors;
    });
    return palette;
}

// 33×33 图标（v14 思路图）：彩色圆角底（70% 透明度）+ 白色线性文件夹（100% 不透明）。
// 全部用 CoreGraphics 画，不加载任何外部图片，因此**不可能出现问号占位图**。
static UIImage *ERQuickAddFolderIconImage(NSInteger row) {
    static UIImage *cached = nil;
    static NSInteger cachedRow = NSNotFound;
    static dispatch_once_t cacheOnce;
    dispatch_once(&cacheOnce, ^{ cached = nil; });
    if (cachedRow == row && cached) return cached;

    UIColor *accent = ERQuickAddIconPalette()[row % ERQuickAddIconPalette().count];

    UIGraphicsImageRendererFormat *format = [[UIGraphicsImageRendererFormat alloc] init];
    format.opaque = NO;
    format.scale = [UIScreen mainScreen].scale;
    UIGraphicsImageRenderer *renderer =
        [[UIGraphicsImageRenderer alloc] initWithSize:CGSizeMake(33.0, 33.0) format:format];

    UIImage *image = [renderer imageWithActions:^(__unused UIGraphicsImageRendererContext *context) {
        // ① 彩色圆角底：70% 透明度（33 盒 · 圆角 10）
        UIBezierPath *container =
            [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:CGRectMake(0.0, 0.0, 33.0, 33.0) cornerRadius:10.0];
        [[accent colorWithAlphaComponent:0.70] setFill];
        [container fill];

        // ② 白色线性文件夹：字形在 33 盒内**两轴精确居中**
        //    （30 盒居中字形 ×1.1：x 8.25..24.75 / y 9.9..23.1，中心 (16.5,16.5)；描边 1.8）
        UIBezierPath *outline = [UIBezierPath bezierPath];
        [outline moveToPoint:CGPointMake(8.25, 23.1)];
        [outline addLineToPoint:CGPointMake(8.25, 12.1)];
        [outline addQuadCurveToPoint:CGPointMake(10.45, 9.9) controlPoint:CGPointMake(8.25, 9.9)];
        [outline addLineToPoint:CGPointMake(14.85, 9.9)];
        [outline addQuadCurveToPoint:CGPointMake(17.05, 12.1) controlPoint:CGPointMake(17.05, 9.9)];
        [outline addLineToPoint:CGPointMake(17.05, 13.2)];
        [outline addLineToPoint:CGPointMake(22.55, 13.2)];
        [outline addQuadCurveToPoint:CGPointMake(24.75, 15.4) controlPoint:CGPointMake(24.75, 13.2)];
        [outline addLineToPoint:CGPointMake(24.75, 20.9)];
        [outline addQuadCurveToPoint:CGPointMake(22.55, 23.1) controlPoint:CGPointMake(24.75, 23.1)];
        [outline closePath];
        outline.lineWidth = 1.8;
        outline.lineJoinStyle = kCGLineJoinRound;
        outline.lineCapStyle = kCGLineCapRound;
        [[UIColor whiteColor] setStroke];
        [outline stroke];
    }];
    cached = image;
    cachedRow = row;
    return image;
}

// cell 副标题（1.0.8-14）：「N个应用程序」，N = 该文件夹内实际应用数。
// 实机（iOS 17.2.1）iconLists/iconListArray/iconList 全部落空 → 战舰式探测：
//   A. 对象键位直读（选择器 + KVC 双路）：iconLists / iconListArray / _iconLists /
//      iconList / _iconList / allIcons / icons，容器逐元素递归计数；
//   B. KVC 数字键（自动装箱，不裸调基本类型选择器）：iconCount / numberOfIcons；
//   C. 二跳：gridCellManager / cellManager / gridLayoutState → 再走 A 组键位；
//   D. 模型侧：iconModel.iconListsForFolderIcon: 等单参选择器 / foldersByName 按名字匹配；
//   E. 全部落空 → 把 folder / folderIcon / model 上含 icon/list/count/grid/cell/layout
//      字样的方法名与 ivar 名一次性转储进日志 —— 下一次修复照实机数据精确实现。
static NSUInteger ERQuickAddCountFromListElement(id element, NSInteger depth) {
    if (!element || depth > 3) return 0;
    if ([element isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]]) {
        NSUInteger sum = 0;
        for (id child in (NSArray *)element) sum += ERQuickAddCountFromListElement(child, depth + 1);
        return sum;
    }
    SEL icons = NSSelectorFromString(@"icons");
    if ([element respondsToSelector:icons]) {
        @try {
            id arr = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(element, icons);
            if ([arr isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]]) return [(NSArray *)arr count];
        } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
    }
    if ([element respondsToSelector:@selector(count)]) {
        return ((NSUInteger (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(element, @selector(count));
    }
    if ([element respondsToSelector:@selector(iconCount)]) {
        return ((NSUInteger (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(element, @selector(iconCount));
    }
    return 0;
}

// 只走 KVC（自动装箱），用于可能返回基本类型的数字键 —— 绝不裸调基本类型选择器
static long ERQuickAddCountViaKVCNumbers(id source, NSArray<NSString *> *keys, NSString **hitKey) {
    if (!source) return -1;
    for (NSString *key in keys) {
        id boxed = nil;
        @try { boxed = [source valueForKey:key]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { boxed = nil; }
        if (![boxed isKindOfClass:[NSNumber class]]) continue;
        long long v = [boxed longLongValue];
        if (v > 0) {
            if (hitKey) *hitKey = key;
            return (long)v;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}

// 对 source 逐键位取列表容器并计数；命中返回正数，全部落空返回 -1
static long ERQuickAddCountViaKeyList(id source, NSArray<NSString *> *keys, NSString **hitKey) {
    if (!source) return -1;
    for (NSString *key in keys) {
        id value = nil;
        SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(key);
        if ([source respondsToSelector:sel]) {
            @try { value = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(source, sel); } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { value = nil; }
        }
        if (!value) {
            @try { value = [source valueForKey:key]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { value = nil; }
        }
        if (!value) continue;
        NSUInteger total = ERQuickAddCountFromListElement(value, 0);
        if (total > 0) {
            if (hitKey) *hitKey = key;
            return (long)total;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}

// 二跳：source → hopKeys 指到的间接对象（grid 管理器等）→ leafKeys 计数
static long ERQuickAddCountViaHops(id source, NSArray<NSString *> *hopKeys, NSArray<NSString *> *leafKeys, NSString **hitPath) {
    if (!source) return -1;
    for (NSString *hop in hopKeys) {
        id mid = nil;
        SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(hop);
        if ([source respondsToSelector:sel]) {
            @try { mid = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(source, sel); } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { mid = nil; }
        }
        if (!mid) {
            @try { mid = [source valueForKey:hop]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { mid = nil; }
        }
        if (!mid || mid == source) continue;
        long r = ERQuickAddCountViaKeyList(mid, leafKeys, nil);
        if (r > 0) {
            if (hitPath) *hitPath = [NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@ → *", hop];
            return r;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}

// 模型侧：iconModel 的单参查询选择器 / foldersByName・folders 按显示名匹配
static long ERQuickAddCountViaModel(id model, id folderIcon, NSString *name, NSString **hitPath) {
    if (!model) return -1;
    for (NSString *selName in @[@"iconListsForFolderIcon:", @"iconListForFolderIcon:", @"iconListsInFolderIcon:"]) {
        SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(selName);
        if (![model respondsToSelector:sel]) continue;
        @try {
            NSMethodSignature *sig = [model methodSignatureForSelector:sel];
            if (!sig || sig.numberOfArguments < 3) continue;
            if (strcmp([sig getArgumentTypeAtIndex:2], @encode(id)) != 0) continue;
            id value = ((id (*)(id, SEL, id))objc_msgSend)(model, sel, folderIcon);
            NSUInteger total = ERQuickAddCountFromListElement(value, 0);
            if (total > 0) {
                if (hitPath) *hitPath = [@"iconModel " stringByAppendingString:selName];
                return (long)total;
            }
        } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
    }
    for (NSString *key in @[@"foldersByName", @"folders", @"_folders"]) {
        id value = nil;
        @try { value = [model valueForKey:key]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { value = nil; }
        if (!value) continue;
        id matched = nil;
        if ([value isKindOfClass:[NSDictionary class]] && name.length) {
            matched = ((NSDictionary *)value)[name];
        } else if ([value isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]]) {
            for (id candidate in (NSArray *)value) {
                NSString *candidateName = [candidate respondsToSelector:@selector(displayName)]
                                              ? ((NSString *(*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(candidate, @selector(displayName)) : nil;
                if ([candidateName isEqualToString:name]) { matched = candidate; break; }
            }
        }
        if (!matched) continue;
        long r = ERQuickAddCountViaKeyList(matched, @[@"iconLists", @"iconListArray", @"_iconLists", @"iconList", @"_iconList", @"allIcons", @"icons"], nil);
        if (r > 0) {
            if (hitPath) *hitPath = [NSString stringWithFormat:@"iconModel %@ → *", key];
            return r;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}

// 一次性转储：对象类上与计数相关的方法名 / ivar 名（每个类只转储一次）
static NSMutableSet<NSString *> *gERQuickAddDumpedClasses = nil;
static void ERQuickAddDumpCountSurface(id obj, NSString *tag) {
    if (!obj) return;
    if (!gERQuickAddDumpedClasses) gERQuickAddDumpedClasses = [NSMutableSet set];
    Class cls = [obj class];
    if (!cls) return;
    NSString *dedupe = [tag stringByAppendingString:NSStringFromClass(cls)];
    if ([gERQuickAddDumpedClasses containsObject:dedupe]) return;
    [gERQuickAddDumpedClasses addObject:dedupe];

    unsigned int methodCount = 0;
    Method *methods = class_copyMethodList(cls, &methodCount);
    NSMutableArray<NSString *> *methodHits = [NSMutableArray array];
    for (unsigned int i = 0; i < methodCount; i++) {
        NSString *name = NSStringFromSelector(method_getName(methods[i]));
        NSString *lower = name.lowercaseString;
        if ([lower containsString:@"icon"] || [lower containsString:@"list"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"count"] || [lower containsString:@"grid"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"cell"] || [lower containsString:@"layout"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"page"]) {
            [methodHits addObject:name];
        }
    }
    free(methods);
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 surface[%@] %@ methods(%lu)=%@",
              tag, NSStringFromClass(cls), (unsigned long)methodHits.count, methodHits);

    unsigned int ivarCount = 0;
    Ivar *ivars = class_copyIvarList(cls, &ivarCount);
    NSMutableArray<NSString *> *ivarHits = [NSMutableArray array];
    for (unsigned int i = 0; i < ivarCount; i++) {
        const char *iname = ivar_getName(ivars[i]);
        if (!iname) continue;
        NSString *name = [NSString stringWithUTF8String:iname];
        NSString *lower = name.lowercaseString;
        if ([lower containsString:@"icon"] || [lower containsString:@"list"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"count"] || [lower containsString:@"grid"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"cell"] || [lower containsString:@"layout"] ||
            [lower containsString:@"page"]) {
            [ivarHits addObject:name];
        }
    }
    free(ivars);
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 surface[%@] %@ ivars(%lu)=%@",
              tag, NSStringFromClass(cls), (unsigned long)ivarHits.count, ivarHits);
}

static NSString *ERQuickAddFolderSubtitle(id folderIcon, id model, NSString *displayName) {
    @try {
        id folder = [folderIcon respondsToSelector:@selector(folder)]
                        ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(folderIcon, @selector(folder)) : nil;
        NSArray<id> *sources = folder ? @[folder, folderIcon] : @[folderIcon];
        // 1.0.8-15：allIcons 是实机（iOS 17.2.1）验证可用的首选路径，置于最前
        NSArray<NSString *> *keys = @[@"allIcons", @"iconLists", @"iconListArray", @"_iconLists",
                                      @"iconList", @"_iconList", @"icons"];
        NSString *hit = nil;
        long total = -1;

        // A. 键位直读
        for (id source in sources) {
            total = ERQuickAddCountViaKeyList(source, keys, &hit);
            if (total > 0) {
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle key=%@ count=%ld", hit, total);
                return [NSString stringWithFormat:@"%lu个应用程序", (unsigned long)total];
            }
        }
        // B. KVC 数字键
        for (id source in sources) {
            total = ERQuickAddCountViaKVCNumbers(source, @[@"iconCount", @"numberOfIcons"], &hit);
            if (total > 0) {
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle kvc=%@ count=%ld", hit, total);
                return [NSString stringWithFormat:@"%lu个应用程序", (unsigned long)total];
            }
        }
        // C. 二跳：grid 管理器 / 布局状态
        for (id source in sources) {
            total = ERQuickAddCountViaHops(source,
                                           @[@"gridCellManager", @"cellManager", @"gridLayoutState", @"_gridCellManager"],
                                           @[@"cells", @"icons", @"iconLists", @"allIcons", @"numberOfIcons", @"iconCount"],
                                           &hit);
            if (total > 0) {
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle via %@ count=%ld", hit, total);
                return [NSString stringWithFormat:@"%lu个应用程序", (unsigned long)total];
            }
        }
        // D. 模型侧
        total = ERQuickAddCountViaModel(model, folderIcon, displayName, &hit);
        if (total > 0) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle via %@ count=%ld", hit, total);
            return [NSString stringWithFormat:@"%lu个应用程序", (unsigned long)total];
        }
        // E. 全部落空 → 转储计数面，供下一次照实机数据精确实现
        if (folder) ERQuickAddDumpCountSurface(folder, @"folder");
        ERQuickAddDumpCountSurface(folderIcon, @"folderIcon");
        if (model) ERQuickAddDumpCountSurface(model, @"model");
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle: no count readable (folder=%@, name=%@)",
                  folder ? NSStringFromClass([folder class]) : @"nil", displayName ?: @"");
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 subtitle EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
    }
    return @"文件夹";
}

// 枚举当前所有文件夹图标（与 picker 同源的轻量版，专供「创建前后做差集」找新文件夹）
static NSArray *ERQuickAddSnapshotFolderIcons(void) {
    NSMutableArray *result = [NSMutableArray array];
    @try {
        id controller = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(%c(SBIconController), @selector(sharedInstance));
        if (!controller) return result;
        id model = nil;
        if ([controller respondsToSelector:@selector(iconModel)]) {
            model = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(controller, @selector(iconModel));
        }
        if (!model) {
            @try { model = [controller valueForKey:@"iconModel"]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
        }
        if (!model) return result;
        id root = [model respondsToSelector:@selector(rootFolder)]
                      ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(model, @selector(rootFolder)) : nil;
        NSArray *lists = nil;
        if (root) {
            for (NSString *key in @[@"lists", @"iconLists"]) {
                @try {
                    id v = [root valueForKey:key];
                    if ([v isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]]) { lists = v; break; }
                } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
            }
        }
        for (id list in lists ?: @[]) {
            id icons = nil;
            @try { icons = [list valueForKey:@"icons"]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
            if (![icons isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] && [list respondsToSelector:@selector(icons)]) {
                icons = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(list, @selector(icons));
            }
            for (id item in [icons isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] ? icons : @[]) {
                if ([item isKindOfClass:%c(SBFolderIcon)]) [result addObject:item];
            }
        }
    } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
    return result;
}

// 创建后重命名：对 folder 依次尝试 setDisplayName: / setTitle: / setName: / renameTo:，
// 全部失效再走 KVC displayName。每一步落日志。
static void ERQuickAddRenameFolder(id folder, NSString *name) {
    if (!folder || !name.length) return;
    for (NSString *selName in @[@"setDisplayName:", @"setTitle:", @"setName:", @"renameTo:"]) {
        SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(selName);
        if (![folder respondsToSelector:sel]) continue;
        @try {
            NSMethodSignature *sig = [folder methodSignatureForSelector:sel];
            if (!sig || sig.numberOfArguments < 3) continue;
            if (strcmp([sig getArgumentTypeAtIndex:2], @encode(id)) != 0) continue;
            ((void (*)(id, SEL, id))objc_msgSend)(folder, sel, name);
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename via %@ → %@", selName, name);
            return;
        } @catch (NSException *e) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename EXC %@ -- %@", selName, e.reason);
        }
    }
    @try {
        [folder setValue:name forKey:@"displayName"];
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename via kvc displayName → %@", name);
        return;
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename kvc EXC %@ -- %@", e.reason);
    }
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename: no usable api on %@",
              NSStringFromClass([folder class]));
}

// 新建文件夹：运行时发现接口；找不到就记一行日志，绝不崩、绝不静默无果。
// 1.0.8-17：创建后按「前后差集」找到新文件夹，并按用户在改名框里输入的名字重命名。
static void ERQuickAddCreateFolderAndMoveIcon(SBIcon *icon, NSString *folderName) {
    if (!icon) return;
    @try {
        NSArray *beforeFolders = ERQuickAddSnapshotFolderIcons();
        NSMutableArray<id> *targets = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (NSString *className in @[@"SBIconController", @"SBIconManager"]) {
            Class cls = NSClassFromString(className);
            if (!cls || ![cls respondsToSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)]) continue;
            @try { [targets addObject:((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(cls, @selector(sharedInstance))]; }
            @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
        }
        NSArray *icons = @[icon];
        for (id target in targets) {
            unsigned int count = 0;
            Method *methods = class_copyMethodList([target class], &count);
            NSMutableArray<NSString *> *hits = [NSMutableArray array];
            for (unsigned int index = 0; index < count; index++) {
                NSString *name = NSStringFromSelector(method_getName(methods[index]));
                if ([name containsString:@"Folder"] &&
                    ([name containsString:@"reate"] || [name containsString:@"ew Fol"])) {
                    if (![hits containsObject:name]) [hits addObject:name];
                }
            }
            free(methods);
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder api-dump cls=%@ hits=%@",
                      NSStringFromClass([target class]), hits);
            for (NSString *name in hits) {
                SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(name);
                if (![target respondsToSelector:sel]) continue;
                @try {
                    NSMethodSignature *sig = [target methodSignatureForSelector:sel];
                    if (!sig || sig.numberOfArguments < 3) continue;
                    NSInvocation *inv = [NSInvocation invocationWithMethodSignature:sig];
                    inv.selector = sel;
                    [inv setArgument:&icons atIndex:2];
                    [inv invokeWithTarget:target];
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder via %@ %@",
                              NSStringFromClass([target class]), name);
                    // 创建成功 → 差集找新文件夹 → 按用户输入的名字重命名
                    NSArray *afterFolders = ERQuickAddSnapshotFolderIcons();
                    NSMutableArray *fresh = [NSMutableArray array];
                    for (id item in afterFolders) {
                        if (![beforeFolders containsObject:item]) [fresh addObject:item];
                    }
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder diff fresh=%lu",
                              (unsigned long)fresh.count);
                    for (id freshIcon in fresh) {
                        id folder = [freshIcon respondsToSelector:@selector(folder)]
                                        ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(freshIcon, @selector(folder)) : nil;
                        ERQuickAddRenameFolder(folder ?: freshIcon, folderName);
                    }
                    return;
                } @catch (NSException *e) {
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
                }
            }
        }
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder: no usable api on %lu target(s)",
                  (unsigned long)targets.count);
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 new-folder EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
    }
}

#pragma mark - 文件夹单元格

@interface ERQuickAddFolderCell : UITableViewCell
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIView *qaCard;        // 圆角 16 的半透明材质底（1px 边缘光）
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIView *qaHighlight;   // 选中：#2E6BFF 纯色胶囊
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIImageView *qaIcon;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UILabel *qaName;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UILabel *qaSubtitle;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UILabel *qaChevron;
@end

@implementation ERQuickAddFolderCell

- (instancetype)initWithStyle:(UITableViewCellStyle)style reuseIdentifier:(NSString *)reuseIdentifier {
    self = [super initWithStyle:style reuseIdentifier:reuseIdentifier];
    if (!self) return nil;
    self.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    self.contentView.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    self.selectionStyle = UITableViewCellSelectionStyleNone;   // 高亮自己画

    // 条目本体：圆角 18、半透明材质，条目之间靠上下 4.5pt 间距区分（不画分割线）
    _qaCard = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaCard.layer.cornerRadius = 18.0;
    _qaCard.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaCard.layer.borderWidth = 1.0;   // 边缘光颜色在 cellForRow 按深浅色写入（v12）
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaCard];

    // 选中高亮：整条胶囊。1.0.8-28 回到 v19 思路图（用户指定 A-1）。
    //
    // v19 CSS 原句：
    //   .row.selected { background:#0A84FF;
    //                   border-color:rgba(80,160,255,0.9);
    //                   box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(10,132,255,0.55),
    //                              0 0 4px  rgba(120,180,255,0.8); }
    // 三层蓝照抄。CA 的 shadowRadius 与 CSS 的 blur-radius 大约是 1:2 的关系
    // （CSS blur-radius = 2σ，CA shadowRadius 就是那个 σ），所以 18px → shadowRadius 9。
    // 4px 那层（0.8 的浅蓝内晕）因为一个图层只能挂一个 shadow，由 borderColor
    // rgba(80,160,255,0.9) 承接同样的"边缘亮一圈"效果。
    _qaHighlight = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaHighlight.layer.cornerRadius = 18.0;
    _qaHighlight.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaHighlight.hidden = YES;
    _qaHighlight.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    // #0A84FF（v19；1.0.8-10 起用的是 #2E6BFF，本次按 A-1 回退）
    _qaHighlight.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:10.0 / 255.0
                                                   green:132.0 / 255.0
                                                    blue:1.00 alpha:1.0];
    _qaHighlight.layer.borderWidth = 1.0;
    _qaHighlight.layer.borderColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:80.0 / 255.0
                                                     green:160.0 / 255.0
                                                      blue:255.0 / 255.0 alpha:0.9].CGColor;
    // v19 的第一层光晕：0 0 18px rgba(10,132,255,0.55)
    _qaHighlight.layer.shadowColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:10.0 / 255.0
                                                     green:132.0 / 255.0
                                                      blue:1.00 alpha:1.0].CGColor;
    _qaHighlight.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.55;
    _qaHighlight.layer.shadowRadius = 9.0;
    _qaHighlight.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeZero;
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaHighlight];
    [self.contentView sendSubviewToBack:_qaHighlight];

    _qaIcon = [[UIImageView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaIcon.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleAspectFit;
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaIcon];

    _qaName = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaName.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0 weight:UIFontWeightMedium];
    // v24：行名白色柔光高光（文字从玻璃面上"浮"出来）
    _qaName.layer.shadowColor = UIColor.whiteColor.CGColor;
    _qaName.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.18;
    _qaName.layer.shadowRadius = 4.0;
    _qaName.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeZero;
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaName];

    _qaSubtitle = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaSubtitle.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:12.0];
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaSubtitle];

    _qaChevron = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaChevron.text = @"›";
    _qaChevron.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:22.0 weight:UIFontWeightRegular];
    _qaChevron.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentRight;
    [self.contentView addSubview:_qaChevron];
    return self;
}

- (void)layoutSubviews {
    [super layoutSubviews];
    CGFloat width = CGRectGetWidth(self.contentView.bounds);
    CGFloat height = CGRectGetHeight(self.contentView.bounds);
    // v14：行距 64 · cell 55（上下各 4.5）· cell 占满行（列表距卡缘 22，与按钮同 span）
    CGFloat insetY = 4.5;
    CGFloat cardWidth = width;
    CGFloat cardHeight = height - insetY * 2.0;   // 55

    _qaCard.frame = CGRectMake(0.0, insetY, cardWidth, cardHeight);
    _qaHighlight.frame = _qaCard.frame;
    // 1.0.8-28：阴影路径 = 胶囊本体、圆角同为 18。CSS 的 box-shadow 是从 border-box
    // 往外糊，并不放大形状，所以这里不做 -10 的外扩（v25 那个外扩写法会让光晕比
    // CSS 明显更重）。
    _qaHighlight.layer.shadowPath =
        [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:_qaHighlight.bounds cornerRadius:18.0].CGPath;

    // 图标 33pt：距 cell 左缘 15，行左侧区域内两轴居中（y 必须含 insetY）
    CGFloat iconSide = 33.0;
    _qaIcon.frame = CGRectMake(15.0, insetY + (cardHeight - iconSide) * 0.5, iconSide, iconSide);
    // 文字块：名字 20 + 2 + 数量 14 = 36，整体垂直居中（块中心 = 图标中心 = 行中心 32）
    CGFloat textX = 59.0;
    CGFloat textW = cardWidth - textX - 44.0;
    CGFloat nameHeight = 20.0, countHeight = 14.0, blockGap = 2.0;
    CGFloat blockTop = (cardHeight - (nameHeight + blockGap + countHeight)) * 0.5;
    _qaName.frame = CGRectMake(textX, insetY + blockTop, textW, nameHeight);
    _qaSubtitle.frame = CGRectMake(textX, CGRectGetMaxY(_qaName.frame) + blockGap, textW, countHeight);
    // chevron：字形中心距 cell 右缘 22（v14）
    _qaChevron.frame = CGRectMake(width - 41.0, 0.0, 24.0, height);
}

- (void)qaSetSelected:(BOOL)selected {
    _qaHighlight.hidden = !selected;
    _qaCard.hidden = selected;   // 选中时整条换成蓝色胶囊，避免两层底色叠灰
    // v14：选中行副标题提亮到白 78%（普通行深色白 60% / 浅色 secondaryLabel）
    BOOL dark = NO;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) dark = (self.traitCollection.userInterfaceStyle == UIUserInterfaceStyleDark);
    _qaSubtitle.textColor = selected
        ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.78]
        : (dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.60] : [UIColor secondaryLabelColor]);
}

@end

static UIWindow *gERQuickAddSheetWindow = nil;

@interface ERQuickAddSheetController : UIViewController <UITableViewDataSource, UITableViewDelegate>
@property (nonatomic, copy) NSArray<NSString *> *titles;      // 运行时读取的文件夹名
@property (nonatomic, copy) NSArray<NSString *> *subtitles;   // 运行时读取的副标题（项目数）
@property (nonatomic, copy) void (^onPick)(NSInteger index);
@property (nonatomic, copy) void (^onCreateFolder)(NSString *folderName);
@end

@implementation ERQuickAddSheetController {
    UIView *_qaBackdrop;               // ① 外部背景（1.0.8-19：桌面快照铺底）
    UIView *_qaDim;                    // ② 黑 30% 压暗层 + 点击关闭命中区（v14）
    UILabel *_qaTitle;
    UILabel *_qaSubtitle;
    UIView *_qaCardHost;               // ③ 卡片（v24：发丝边 + 镜面高光描边）
    UIView *_qaGlass;                  //   自绘玻璃容器（v24：模糊 6 取景 + 卡内压暗 32%）
    UIImageView *_qaGlassImage;        //   模糊后的桌面快照（按卡片位置取景）
    UIView *_qaGlassDark;              // v24：卡内压暗 32%（亮度衔接 —— 防"发白"的核心）
    UIView *_qaGlassTint;             // v25：玻璃底染色（背景色值滑块控透明度，色板/自定义控 RGB）
    CAGradientLayer *_qaSpecular;      // v24：镜面高光描边（liquidass 六段渐变 · -45° · α0.35）
    CAShapeLayer *_qaSpecularMask;     //      高光描边的圆角路径掩码（1pt）
    UITableView *_qaTable;             // ⑤ 列表
    UIButton *_qaPrimary;              // ⑧ 按钮
    UIButton *_qaCancel;
    UILabel *_qaVersion;               // 版本水印（面板底部小字，排查安装是否生效）
    BOOL _qaDismissing;
}

- (void)viewDidLoad {
    [super viewDidLoad];
    self.view.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    // v21：全深色模式外观（背景恒压暗 30%，不再跟随系统深浅色）
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) self.overrideUserInterfaceStyle = UIUserInterfaceStyleDark;

    // ① 外部背景（1.0.8-23）：**实时直透** —— 窗口保持全透明，真实桌面
    //    （活的壁纸 / 图标 / Dock）直接透出，只叠一层黑 30% 压暗（下一步的 _qaDim）。
    //    不再用截图铺底 → 面板可以**即时弹出**（速度回到"刚刚好"）。
    _qaBackdrop = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:self.view.bounds];
    _qaBackdrop.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    _qaBackdrop.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    [self.view addSubview:_qaBackdrop];
    // 卡片玻璃仍需「桌面模糊副本」（系统模糊在本场景恒失败），此快照**仅用于玻璃糊化**
    UIImage *desktopSnapshot = ERQuickAddCaptureDesktopImage();

    // ② 压暗层 + 命中区：v14 压暗调到 **黑 30%**（用户指定）；点背景空白处关闭。
    //    1.0.8-25：改为读取设置页「框外压暗」滑块（0–100，默认 30；0 = 不压暗）。
    _qaDim = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:self.view.bounds];
    _qaDim.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    {
        CGFloat outsideDark = ERQuickAddOutsideDarkness();
        _qaDim.backgroundColor = (outsideDark > 0.0)
            ? [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:outsideDark / 100.0]
            : UIColor.clearColor;
    }
    [_qaDim addGestureRecognizer:[[UITapGestureRecognizer alloc] initWithTarget:self action:@selector(qaDismissAnimated)]];
    [self.view addSubview:_qaDim];

    // 1.0.8-29：1.0.8-28 曾在这里加过一层全屏 `_qaOutsideTint`（把「背景色」也刷到框外）。
    // 用户实测后要求退回：框外不要染色，**「背景色值」只控制框内**。故整层删除，
    // 框外回到「只有黑压暗」的原状。背景色（色相 + 透明度）全部只作用在 _qaGlass 上。

    // ④ 标题 / 副标题在卡片上方，顶部留白（v14：26 / 14）
    // ④ 标题 / 副标题（v24：26→32 / 14→18；加白色柔光高光让文字从玻璃上"浮"出来）
    _qaTitle = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaTitle.text = @"添加到文件夹";
    _qaTitle.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:32.0 weight:UIFontWeightSemibold];
    _qaTitle.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentCenter;
    _qaTitle.layer.shadowColor = UIColor.whiteColor.CGColor;
    _qaTitle.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.35;
    _qaTitle.layer.shadowRadius = 7.0;
    _qaTitle.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeZero;
    [self.view addSubview:_qaTitle];

    _qaSubtitle = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaSubtitle.text = @"选择一个目标文件夹";
    _qaSubtitle.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:18.0 weight:UIFontWeightRegular];
    _qaSubtitle.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentCenter;
    _qaSubtitle.layer.shadowColor = UIColor.whiteColor.CGColor;
    _qaSubtitle.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.28;
    _qaSubtitle.layer.shadowRadius = 5.0;
    _qaSubtitle.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeZero;
    [self.view addSubview:_qaSubtitle];

    // ③ 卡片（v24）：发丝边 1pt（分隔色 16%）+ 镜面高光描边；卡内 = 自绘玻璃
    _qaCardHost = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaCardHost.layer.cornerRadius = kERQACardCornerRadius;
    _qaCardHost.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaCardHost.layer.borderColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:120.0 / 255.0 green:120.0 / 255.0
                                                    blue:128.0 / 255.0 alpha:0.16].CGColor;
    _qaCardHost.layer.borderWidth = 1.0;
    [self.view addSubview:_qaCardHost];

    _qaGlass = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:_qaCardHost.bounds];
    _qaGlass.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    _qaGlass.layer.cornerRadius = kERQACardCornerRadius;
    _qaGlass.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaGlass.clipsToBounds = YES;
    _qaGlass.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    [_qaCardHost addSubview:_qaGlass];

    // v24 自绘玻璃：模糊后的桌面快照按「卡片在屏幕中的位置」对齐取景（模糊 8→6）
    _qaGlassImage = [[UIImageView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaGlassImage.image = desktopSnapshot ? ERQuickAddBlurredImage(desktopSnapshot, ERQuickAddInsideBlur()) : nil;
    _qaGlassImage.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleToFill;
    _qaGlassImage.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [_qaGlass addSubview:_qaGlassImage];

    // v24 卡内压暗 32%（原白膜 5% 移除）—— 亮度衔接、从物理上防"发白"。
    //    1.0.8-25：改为读取设置页「框内压暗」滑块（0–100，默认 30；0 = 不压暗）。
    _qaGlassDark = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:_qaGlass.bounds];
    _qaGlassDark.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    _qaGlassDark.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    {
        CGFloat insideDark = ERQuickAddInsideDarkness();
        _qaGlassDark.backgroundColor = (insideDark > 0.0)
            ? [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:insideDark / 100.0]
            : UIColor.clearColor;
    }
    [_qaGlass addSubview:_qaGlassDark];

    // v25：玻璃底染色层（设置页「背景色值」滑块控透明度 + 色板/自定义 RGB 控色相；默认灰蓝 38,45,48 / 88）
    _qaGlassTint = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:_qaGlass.bounds];
    _qaGlassTint.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    _qaGlassTint.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    {
        CGFloat alpha = ERQuickAddBackgroundAlpha() / 100.0;
        _qaGlassTint.backgroundColor = [ERQuickAddTintColor() colorWithAlphaComponent:alpha];
    }
    [_qaGlass insertSubview:_qaGlassTint aboveSubview:_qaGlassDark];

    // v24 镜面高光描边（liquidass `_specularLayer` 原样：1pt 六段渐变 · -45° · α 基数 0.35）
    _qaSpecularMask = [CAShapeLayer layer];
    _qaSpecularMask.fillColor = UIColor.clearColor.CGColor;
    _qaSpecularMask.strokeColor = UIColor.blackColor.CGColor;
    _qaSpecularMask.lineWidth = 1.0;
    _qaSpecular = [CAGradientLayer layer];
    _qaSpecular.locations = @[@0.0, @0.12, @0.34, @0.66, @0.88, @1.0];
    _qaSpecular.colors = @[
        (id)[UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.098].CGColor,
        (id)[UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.035].CGColor,
        (id)UIColor.clearColor.CGColor,
        (id)UIColor.clearColor.CGColor,
        (id)[UIColor colorWithWhite:0.0 alpha:0.014].CGColor,
        (id)[UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.042].CGColor,
    ];
    CGFloat specDX = cos(-M_PI_4) * 0.5, specDY = sin(-M_PI_4) * 0.5;
    _qaSpecular.startPoint = CGPointMake(0.5 + specDX, 0.5 + specDY);
    _qaSpecular.endPoint = CGPointMake(0.5 - specDX, 0.5 - specDY);
    _qaSpecular.mask = _qaSpecularMask;
    [_qaCardHost.layer addSublayer:_qaSpecular];

    // ⑤ 列表：固定 5 行整，无分割线，条目之间用间距区分
    _qaTable = [[UITableView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero style:UITableViewStylePlain];
    _qaTable.dataSource = self;
    _qaTable.delegate = self;
    _qaTable.rowHeight = kERQARowHeight;
    _qaTable.separatorStyle = UITableViewCellSeparatorStyleNone;
    _qaTable.showsVerticalScrollIndicator = NO;
    _qaTable.alwaysBounceVertical = NO;
    _qaTable.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    _qaTable.clipsToBounds = YES;
    if (@available(iOS 15.0, *)) _qaTable.sectionHeaderTopPadding = 0.0;
    [_qaTable registerClass:[ERQuickAddFolderCell class] forCellReuseIdentifier:@"QACell"];
    [_qaGlass addSubview:_qaTable];

    // ⑧ 底部两个胶囊按钮（v14：147×50、圆角 25、间距 12、纯色 #2E6BFF 主按钮）
    _qaPrimary = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
    [_qaPrimary setTitle:@"新建文件夹" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _qaPrimary.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0 weight:UIFontWeightMedium];
    [_qaPrimary addTarget:self action:@selector(qaCreateFolderTapped) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
    _qaPrimary.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:46.0 / 255.0 green:107.0 / 255.0 blue:1.00 alpha:1.0];
    _qaPrimary.layer.cornerRadius = kERQAButtonCornerRadius;
    _qaPrimary.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaPrimary.clipsToBounds = YES;
    [_qaGlass addSubview:_qaPrimary];

    _qaCancel = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
    [_qaCancel setTitle:@"取消" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _qaCancel.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0 weight:UIFontWeightRegular];
    [_qaCancel addTarget:self action:@selector(qaDismissAnimated) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
    _qaCancel.layer.cornerRadius = kERQAButtonCornerRadius;
    _qaCancel.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _qaCancel.clipsToBounds = YES;
    [_qaGlass addSubview:_qaCancel];

    // 版本水印：面板下方的小字 —— 设备上「看一眼就知道跑的是哪个版本」
    _qaVersion = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _qaVersion.text = [@"Echo Reborn " stringByAppendingString:kERQuickAddPanelVersion];
    _qaVersion.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:11.0];
    _qaVersion.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentCenter;
    _qaVersion.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [self.view addSubview:_qaVersion];

    [self qaApplyAppearance];
    // v14：过渡动画 —— 上屏前整体透明，viewDidAppear 时淡入（0.18s，无缩放无弹跳）
    self.view.alpha = 0.0;
}

- (CGFloat)qaTableHeight {
    NSUInteger count = self.titles.count;
    if (count == 0) return kERQARowHeight;
    // 1.0.8-28：行数上限按屏幕高度取 6 或 5（见 ERQuickAddVisibleRows）。
    // 文件夹少于上限时按实际条数收窄，多于上限时按上限并允许内部滚动。
    NSUInteger visible = (NSUInteger)ERQuickAddVisibleRows();
    if (count <= visible) return (CGFloat)count * kERQARowHeight;
    return (CGFloat)visible * kERQARowHeight;
}

- (void)qaApplyAppearance {
    BOOL dark = NO;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) dark = (self.traitCollection.userInterfaceStyle == UIUserInterfaceStyleDark);

    _qaTitle.textColor = dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor;
    _qaSubtitle.textColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.78] : [UIColor secondaryLabelColor];

    // v24：玻璃叠层固定（卡内压暗 32%，无灰层），不随深浅色切换。

    // ⑦ 按钮配色
    [_qaPrimary setTitleColor:UIColor.whiteColor forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    [_qaCancel setTitleColor:dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _qaCancel.backgroundColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.10]
                                     : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.07];
    _qaVersion.textColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.30]
                                : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.35];

    [_qaTable reloadData];
}

- (void)traitCollectionDidChange:(UITraitCollection *)previousTraitCollection {
    [super traitCollectionDidChange:previousTraitCollection];
    [self qaApplyAppearance];   // v21：玻璃改为自绘，不再有 effect 需要同步
}

- (void)viewDidLayoutSubviews {
    [super viewDidLayoutSubviews];
    CGFloat width = CGRectGetWidth(self.view.bounds);
    CGFloat height = CGRectGetHeight(self.view.bounds);
    CGFloat cardWidth = MIN(kERQACardWidth, width - 48.0);
    CGFloat tableHeight = [self qaTableHeight];
    // v14 卡片纵向节奏：上 22 + 列表 320 + 间距 16 + 按钮 50 + 下 20 = 428
    CGFloat cardHeight = kERQACardTopPad + tableHeight + kERQATableButtonGap + kERQAButtonHeight + kERQACardBottomPad;
    CGFloat gapTitleCard = 22.0;
    CGFloat totalHeight = kERQATitleHeight + 7.0 + kERQASubtitleHeight + gapTitleCard + cardHeight;
    CGFloat top = MAX(12.0, (height - totalHeight) * 0.5);
    CGFloat cardX = (width - cardWidth) * 0.5;

    _qaTitle.frame = CGRectMake(24.0, top, width - 48.0, kERQATitleHeight);
    _qaSubtitle.frame = CGRectMake(24.0, CGRectGetMaxY(_qaTitle.frame) + 7.0, width - 48.0, kERQASubtitleHeight);

    CGFloat cardY = CGRectGetMaxY(_qaSubtitle.frame) + gapTitleCard;
    _qaCardHost.frame = CGRectMake(cardX, cardY, cardWidth, cardHeight);
    _qaGlass.frame = _qaCardHost.bounds;
    // v21：自绘毛玻璃取景 —— 模糊全屏图按卡片在屏幕中的位置对齐（卡内即"透过玻璃"）
    _qaGlassImage.frame = CGRectMake(-cardX, -cardY, width, height);
    // v24：镜面高光描边的圆角路径（内缩 0.5pt 让 1pt 描边完全落在卡内）
    _qaSpecular.frame = _qaCardHost.bounds;
    _qaSpecularMask.frame = _qaCardHost.bounds;
    _qaSpecularMask.path =
        [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:CGRectInset(_qaCardHost.bounds, 0.5, 0.5)
                                   cornerRadius:kERQACardCornerRadius - 0.5].CGPath;
    _qaCardHost.layer.shadowPath =
        [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:_qaCardHost.bounds cornerRadius:kERQACardCornerRadius].CGPath;

    CGFloat innerX = kERQACardInnerPadding * 0.5;   // 列表距卡缘 22（与按钮行同 span，内容宽 306）
    _qaTable.frame = CGRectMake(innerX, kERQACardTopPad, cardWidth - innerX * 2.0, tableHeight);

    // v14：按钮 147×50、间距 12、距卡缘 22；窄屏时两枚均分可用宽度
    CGFloat buttonWidth = MIN(147.0, (cardWidth - kERQAButtonInset * 2.0 - kERQAButtonGap) * 0.5);
    CGFloat buttonY = CGRectGetMaxY(_qaTable.frame) + kERQATableButtonGap;
    _qaPrimary.frame = CGRectMake(kERQAButtonInset, buttonY, buttonWidth, kERQAButtonHeight);
    _qaCancel.frame = CGRectMake(CGRectGetMaxX(_qaPrimary.frame) + kERQAButtonGap, buttonY, buttonWidth, kERQAButtonHeight);

    // 版本水印：卡片下方 12pt、居中
    _qaVersion.frame = CGRectMake(24.0, CGRectGetMaxY(_qaCardHost.frame) + 12.0, width - 48.0, 14.0);
}

#pragma mark - 表格

- (NSInteger)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView numberOfRowsInSection:(NSInteger)section {
    return (NSInteger)self.titles.count;
}

- (CGFloat)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView heightForRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    return kERQARowHeight;
}

- (UITableViewCell *)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView cellForRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    ERQuickAddFolderCell *cell = [tableView dequeueReusableCellWithIdentifier:@"QACell" forIndexPath:indexPath];
    NSUInteger row = (NSUInteger)indexPath.row;
    BOOL dark = NO;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) dark = (self.traitCollection.userInterfaceStyle == UIUserInterfaceStyleDark);

    cell.qaName.text = (row < self.titles.count) ? self.titles[row] : @"";
    cell.qaSubtitle.text = (row < self.subtitles.count) ? self.subtitles[row] : @"";
    cell.qaName.textColor = dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor;
    cell.qaSubtitle.textColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.60] : [UIColor secondaryLabelColor];
    cell.qaChevron.textColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.34]
                                    : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.26];

    // ⑥ 图标：CoreGraphics 代码绘制（彩色圆角底 + 白色线性文件夹），**没有问号占位图**
    cell.qaIcon.image = ERQuickAddFolderIconImage((NSInteger)row);

    // cell 半透明材质底（1.0.8-28 回到 v19 CSS 原值：0.05 → 0.06）
    //
    // v19 思路图里 `.row { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08) }`。
    // 注：1.0.8-27 曾把它压到 0.02 去对齐参考图的"隐形 pill"，本次按用户指定回退到 v19 原值。
    cell.qaCard.backgroundColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.06]
                                      : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.06];
    // 1.0.8-28：1px 边缘光回到 v19 的 0.08（1.0.8-27 是 0.10；浅色白 35% 保持）
    cell.qaCard.layer.borderColor =
        [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:(dark ? 0.08 : 0.35)].CGColor;
    cell.qaCard.layer.borderWidth = 1.0;
    [cell qaSetSelected:NO];
    return cell;
}

- (void)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView willDisplayCell:(UITableViewCell *)cell forRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    [(ERQuickAddFolderCell *)cell qaSetSelected:NO];
}

- (void)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView didHighlightRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    // v25：按下即亮 —— 手指触下瞬间即给该行上 #2E6BFF 高亮 + 蓝色光晕（不按思路图 0A84FF/18px）
    UITableViewCell *cell = [tableView cellForRowAtIndexPath:indexPath];
    if ([cell isKindOfClass:[ERQuickAddFolderCell class]]) {
        [(ERQuickAddFolderCell *)cell qaSetSelected:YES];
    }
}

- (void)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView didUnhighlightRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    // 拖离取消：抬起时若未落在原行（didSelect 不触发），清掉高亮，避免卡住
    UITableViewCell *cell = [tableView cellForRowAtIndexPath:indexPath];
    if ([cell isKindOfClass:[ERQuickAddFolderCell class]]) {
        [(ERQuickAddFolderCell *)cell qaSetSelected:NO];
    }
}

- (void)tableView:(UITableView *)tableView didSelectRowAtIndexPath:(NSIndexPath *)indexPath {
    // 1.0.8-18 · 修复②：先给选中行上「蓝色胶囊高亮」（#2E6BFF 整条 + 副标题提亮），
    // 可见停留 0.16s 后再关闭面板执行动作 —— 此前选中即秒关，高亮从未被看到。
    UITableViewCell *cell = [tableView cellForRowAtIndexPath:indexPath];
    if ([cell isKindOfClass:[ERQuickAddFolderCell class]]) {
        [(ERQuickAddFolderCell *)cell qaSetSelected:YES];
    }
    void (^handler)(NSInteger) = self.onPick;
    NSInteger row = indexPath.row;
    dispatch_after(dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(0.16 * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                   dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{
        [self qaDismiss:^{ if (handler) handler(row); }];
    });
}

#pragma mark - 动作

- (void)qaCreateFolderTapped {
    // 1.0.8-18 · 修复③：先**关闭本面板**，关闭完成后再弹「自绘改名框」——
    // 两者不再并存；改名框为自绘控件（不再是 UIAlertController，
    // 杜绝 iOS 17 上弹窗渲染为空/只显示标题的问题）。
    void (^handler)(NSString *) = self.onCreateFolder;
    [self qaDismiss:^{
        ERQuickAddPresentRenameDialog(^(NSString *name) {
            if (handler) handler(name);
        });
    }];
}

- (void)qaDismissAnimated {
    [self qaDismiss:nil];
}

- (void)qaDismiss:(void (^)(void))completion {
    // v14：过渡动画 —— 轻柔淡出（0.15s，无缩放），完成后拆窗
    if (_qaDismissing) return;
    _qaDismissing = YES;
    [UIView animateWithDuration:0.15 delay:0.0 options:UIViewAnimationOptionCurveEaseIn animations:^{
        self.view.alpha = 0.0;
    } completion:^(__unused BOOL finished) {
        [self tearDownAfterDismiss];
        if (completion) completion();
    }];
}

#pragma mark - 窗口

- (void)presentOverDock {
    // iOS 13 起手工窗口必须挂到 UIWindowScene 才会被渲染；高 windowLevel 的窗口
    // 需要 makeKeyAndVisible 才会真正上屏并触发 viewDidAppear（入场动画在那里）。
    UIWindowScene *scene = ERQuickAddMainScene();
    UIWindow *host = scene ? [[UIWindow alloc] initWithWindowScene:scene]
                           : [[UIWindow alloc] initWithFrame:[UIScreen mainScreen].bounds];
    host.frame = [UIScreen mainScreen].bounds;
    host.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    host.opaque = NO;
    host.windowLevel = 100.0;   // 与 1.0.8-2 一致
    host.rootViewController = self;
    gERQuickAddSheetWindow = host;
    [host makeKeyAndVisible];
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 sheet window scene=%@ level=%.1f key=%d",
              scene ? NSStringFromClass(scene.class) : @"(nil)", host.windowLevel, (int)host.isKeyWindow);
}

- (void)tearDownAfterDismiss {
    UIWindow *host = gERQuickAddSheetWindow;
    gERQuickAddSheetWindow = nil;
    if (!host) return;
    host.hidden = YES;
    host.rootViewController = nil;
}

- (void)viewDidAppear:(BOOL)animated {
    // v14：过渡动画 —— 轻柔淡入（0.18s，纯透明度，无缩放、无弹跳）
    [super viewDidAppear:animated];
    [UIView animateWithDuration:0.18 delay:0.0 options:UIViewAnimationOptionCurveEaseOut
                     animations:^{ self.view.alpha = 1.0; } completion:nil];
}

@end

#pragma mark - 改名框（1.0.8-18：自绘，替代 UIAlertController）

// 与主面板同款的窗口方案：独立 UIWindow、层级 100（已锁定）、挂到前台 WindowScene。
// 1.0.8-36 · 锁屏音乐条的尺寸上限（见 ERMusicViewLooksLikeNowPlayingBar）。
// 锁屏实测 339×75，取 220 留足余量；超过这个高度的一律判定为容器，绝不隐藏。
static CGFloat const kERMusicNowPlayingBarMaxHeight = 220.0;

static UIWindow *gERQuickAddRenameWindow = nil;

@interface ERQuickAddRenameController : UIViewController <UITextFieldDelegate>
@property (nonatomic, copy) void (^onConfirm)(NSString *name);
@end

@implementation ERQuickAddRenameController {
    UIView *_rnDim;
    UIView *_rnCard;
    UIImageView *_rnGlassImage;   // v21：模糊快照取景（自绘毛玻璃）
    UILabel *_rnTitle;
    UITextField *_rnField;
    UIButton *_rnCancel;
    UIButton *_rnConfirm;
    BOOL _rnClosing;
}

- (void)viewDidLoad {
    [super viewDidLoad];
    self.view.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    BOOL dark = YES;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) {
        self.overrideUserInterfaceStyle = UIUserInterfaceStyleDark;   // v21：全深色外观
        dark = (self.traitCollection.userInterfaceStyle == UIUserInterfaceStyleDark);
    }

    // v14 修复③：**移除外层灰底** —— 弹窗周围只保留透明命中区（点外取消），
    // 不再有毛玻璃背景层、不再有压暗层；后面直接是系统桌面本身。
    _rnDim = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:self.view.bounds];
    _rnDim.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    _rnDim.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    [_rnDim addGestureRecognizer:[[UITapGestureRecognizer alloc] initWithTarget:self action:@selector(rnCancelTapped)]];
    [self.view addSubview:_rnDim];

    // 卡片：v14/v21 自绘薄毛玻璃（模糊快照取景 + 白 10% 玻璃膜），圆角 24、白 22% 发丝描边
    _rnCard = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _rnCard.layer.cornerRadius = 24.0;
    _rnCard.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _rnCard.layer.borderWidth = 0.6;
    _rnCard.layer.borderColor = [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.22].CGColor;
    _rnCard.layer.shadowColor = UIColor.blackColor.CGColor;
    _rnCard.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.30;
    _rnCard.layer.shadowRadius = 28.0;
    _rnCard.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeMake(0.0, 10.0);
    [self.view addSubview:_rnCard];

    UIView *glass = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:_rnCard.bounds];
    glass.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    glass.layer.cornerRadius = 24.0;
    glass.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    glass.clipsToBounds = YES;
    glass.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    [_rnCard addSubview:glass];
    // 模糊快照取景（布局时按卡片位置对齐；v24：模糊 6 · 卡内压暗 32% 替换白膜）。
    //    1.0.8-25：模糊半径读取设置页「框内模糊」滑块（0–30，默认 6）。
    _rnGlassImage = [[UIImageView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    UIImage *rnSnapshot = ERQuickAddCaptureDesktopImage();
    _rnGlassImage.image = rnSnapshot ? ERQuickAddBlurredImage(rnSnapshot, ERQuickAddInsideBlur()) : nil;
    _rnGlassImage.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleToFill;
    _rnGlassImage.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [glass addSubview:_rnGlassImage];
    UIView *glassDark = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:glass.bounds];
    glassDark.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    glassDark.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    {
        CGFloat insideDark = ERQuickAddInsideDarkness();
        glassDark.backgroundColor = (insideDark > 0.0)
            ? [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:insideDark / 100.0]
            : UIColor.clearColor;
    }
    [glass addSubview:glassDark];

    _rnTitle = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _rnTitle.text = @"新建文件夹";
    _rnTitle.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:17.0 weight:UIFontWeightSemibold];
    _rnTitle.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentCenter;
    _rnTitle.textColor = dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor;
    [glass addSubview:_rnTitle];

    // 1.0.8-18：输入框**内容为空**，只留占位提示 —— 不再预填「新建文件夹」文字
    _rnField = [[UITextField alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    _rnField.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0];
    _rnField.textColor = dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor;
    _rnField.attributedPlaceholder = [[NSAttributedString alloc] initWithString:@"输入文件夹名称"
        attributes:@{ NSForegroundColorAttributeName:
                          dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.38] : [UIColor tertiaryLabelColor] }];
    _rnField.backgroundColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.10]
                                    : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.06];
    _rnField.layer.cornerRadius = 10.0;
    _rnField.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    _rnField.leftView = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectMake(0.0, 0.0, 12.0, 44.0)];
    _rnField.leftViewMode = UITextFieldViewModeAlways;
    _rnField.clearButtonMode = UITextFieldViewModeWhileEditing;
    _rnField.returnKeyType = UIReturnKeyDone;
    _rnField.delegate = self;
    [glass addSubview:_rnField];

    _rnCancel = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
    [_rnCancel setTitle:@"取消" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _rnCancel.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0 weight:UIFontWeightRegular];
    [_rnCancel setTitleColor:dark ? UIColor.whiteColor : UIColor.labelColor forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _rnCancel.backgroundColor = dark ? [[UIColor whiteColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.14]
                                     : [[UIColor blackColor] colorWithAlphaComponent:0.07];
    _rnCancel.layer.cornerRadius = 22.0;
    _rnCancel.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    [_rnCancel addTarget:self action:@selector(rnCancelTapped) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
    [glass addSubview:_rnCancel];

    _rnConfirm = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
    [_rnConfirm setTitle:@"确定" forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _rnConfirm.titleLabel.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:16.0 weight:UIFontWeightMedium];
    [_rnConfirm setTitleColor:UIColor.whiteColor forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    _rnConfirm.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithRed:46.0 / 255.0 green:107.0 / 255.0 blue:1.00 alpha:1.0];
    _rnConfirm.layer.cornerRadius = 22.0;
    _rnConfirm.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous;
    [_rnConfirm addTarget:self action:@selector(rnConfirmTapped) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
    [glass addSubview:_rnConfirm];

    // v14：过渡动画 —— 上屏前整体透明，viewDidAppear 时淡入
    self.view.alpha = 0.0;
}

- (void)viewDidLayoutSubviews {
    [super viewDidLayoutSubviews];
    CGFloat width = CGRectGetWidth(self.view.bounds);
    CGFloat height = CGRectGetHeight(self.view.bounds);
    CGFloat cardWidth = 300.0, cardHeight = 180.0;
    CGFloat cardX = (width - cardWidth) * 0.5;
    CGFloat cardY = (height - cardHeight) * 0.5;
    _rnCard.frame = CGRectMake(cardX, cardY, cardWidth, cardHeight);
    // v21：自绘毛玻璃取景（模糊全屏图按对话框位置对齐）
    _rnGlassImage.frame = CGRectMake(-cardX, -cardY, width, height);
    _rnCard.layer.shadowPath =
        [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:_rnCard.bounds cornerRadius:24.0].CGPath;
    _rnTitle.frame = CGRectMake(20.0, 20.0, cardWidth - 40.0, 22.0);
    _rnField.frame = CGRectMake(20.0, 56.0, cardWidth - 40.0, 44.0);
    CGFloat gap = 10.0;
    CGFloat buttonWidth = (cardWidth - 40.0 - gap) * 0.5;
    CGFloat buttonY = 116.0;
    _rnCancel.frame = CGRectMake(20.0, buttonY, buttonWidth, 44.0);
    _rnConfirm.frame = CGRectMake(20.0 + buttonWidth + gap, buttonY, buttonWidth, 44.0);
}

- (void)viewDidAppear:(BOOL)animated {
    // v14：轻柔淡入（0.18s，无缩放）+ 自动聚焦调起键盘
    [super viewDidAppear:animated];
    [UIView animateWithDuration:0.18 delay:0.0 options:UIViewAnimationOptionCurveEaseOut
                     animations:^{ self.view.alpha = 1.0; } completion:nil];
    // 1.0.8-31：键盘不再自动弹出 —— 用户反馈「新建文件夹，不弹出键盘，之前都是自动弹出的」。
    // 原来只在 viewDidAppear 里调一次 becomeFirstResponder；宿主 window 刚 makeKeyAndVisible，
    // 此时 first responder 链还没完全建立，这次调用可能被静默吞掉（返回 NO，无任何提示）。
    // 修法：**多试几次** —— 立即一次 + 0.1s / 0.3s 各补一次，一旦成功就不再重试。
    // 这是 iOS 上"模态浮层里的输入框不弹键盘"的标准解法，不动任何业务逻辑。
    [_rnField becomeFirstResponder];
    __weak typeof(self) weakSelf = self;
    for (NSNumber *delay in @[@0.1, @0.3]) {
        dispatch_after(dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(delay.doubleValue * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                       dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{
            __strong typeof(self) strongSelf = weakSelf;
            if (!strongSelf) return;
            UIWindow *host = gERQuickAddRenameWindow;
            if (!host || host.hidden) return;                    // 小窗已被关掉就别再调
            if (strongSelf->_rnField.isFirstResponder) return;   // 已经起来了
            // 1.0.8-32：**把 key 抢回来**。1.0.8-31 这里检查 `isKeyWindow`、不是就放弃 ——
            // 但主面板的 window 同级（都是 level 100），很可能在我们 makeKey 之后又把 key
            // 抢回去，于是重试永远在这里被拦掉，键盘一次都起不来。
            // 现在改成主动 makeKeyWindow 再聚焦。
            [host makeKeyWindow];
            [strongSelf->_rnField becomeFirstResponder];
        });
    }
}

- (void)rnCancelTapped {
    [self rnClose:nil];
}

- (void)rnConfirmTapped {
    NSString *name = [_rnField.text stringByTrimmingCharactersInSet:[NSCharacterSet whitespaceAndNewlineCharacterSet]];
    if (name.length == 0) name = @"新建文件夹";
    void (^callback)(NSString *) = self.onConfirm;
    [self rnClose:^{ if (callback) callback(name); }];
}

- (void)rnClose:(void (^)(void))completion {
    // v14：轻柔淡出（0.15s），完成后拆窗
    if (_rnClosing) return;
    _rnClosing = YES;
    [_rnField resignFirstResponder];
    [UIView animateWithDuration:0.15 delay:0.0 options:UIViewAnimationOptionCurveEaseIn animations:^{
        self.view.alpha = 0.0;
    } completion:^(__unused BOOL finished) {
        UIWindow *host = gERQuickAddRenameWindow;
        gERQuickAddRenameWindow = nil;
        if (host) {
            host.hidden = YES;
            host.rootViewController = nil;
        }
        if (completion) completion();
    }];
}

- (BOOL)textFieldShouldReturn:(UITextField *)textField {
    [self rnConfirmTapped];
    return YES;
}

@end

// 1.0.8-20：桌面快照 —— 只截「壁纸 / 主屏 / Dock」三类窗口（v14 收紧白名单：
// 此前混入了 13 个无关窗口 —— UITextEffects、其他插件的控制台窗口等）。
// 同进程公开渲染 API（drawViewHierarchyInRect），失败时返回 nil 并落日志。
static UIImage *ERQuickAddCaptureDesktopImage(void) {
    @try {
        NSMutableArray<UIWindow *> *below = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (UIWindow *w in [UIApplication sharedApplication].windows) {
            if (!w || w.hidden || w.alpha < 0.01) continue;
            if (w == gERQuickAddSheetWindow || w == gERQuickAddRenameWindow) continue;
            if (w.windowLevel >= 100.0) continue;   // 只取本弹窗层级以下的窗口
            NSString *cls = NSStringFromClass([w class]) ?: @"";
            // v14 白名单：壁纸窗口 / 主屏窗口 / Dock 窗口
            if (![cls containsString:@"Wallpaper"] &&
                ![cls containsString:@"HomeScreen"] &&
                ![cls containsString:@"Dock"]) continue;
            [below addObject:w];
        }
        if (!below.count) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 desktop snapshot: no whitelisted window below level 100");
            return nil;
        }
        [below sortUsingComparator:^NSComparisonResult(UIWindow *a, UIWindow *b) {
            if (a.windowLevel < b.windowLevel) return NSOrderedAscending;
            if (a.windowLevel > b.windowLevel) return NSOrderedDescending;
            return NSOrderedSame;
        }];
        CGRect screenBounds = [UIScreen mainScreen].bounds;
        UIGraphicsImageRendererFormat *format = [UIGraphicsImageRendererFormat defaultFormat];
        format.scale = 1.0;    // 1x 输出：内存可控，画面自带柔和感
        format.opaque = NO;
        UIGraphicsImageRenderer *renderer =
            [[UIGraphicsImageRenderer alloc] initWithSize:screenBounds.size format:format];
        NSMutableArray<NSString *> *captured = [NSMutableArray array];
        UIImage *image = [renderer imageWithActions:^(__unused UIGraphicsImageRendererContext *context) {
            for (UIWindow *window in below) {
                @try {
                    [window drawViewHierarchyInRect:CGRectMake(0.0, 0.0,
                                                               CGRectGetWidth(window.bounds),
                                                               CGRectGetHeight(window.bounds))
                                 afterScreenUpdates:NO];
                    [captured addObject:NSStringFromClass([window class])];
                } @catch (NSException *e) {
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 desktop snapshot EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
                }
            }
        }];
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 desktop snapshot: %lu window(s) %@ -> %@",
                  (unsigned long)captured.count, captured, NSStringFromCGSize(image.size));
        return captured.count ? image : nil;
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 desktop snapshot EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
        return nil;
    }
}

// 1.0.8-21 · 修复②：卡片「自绘毛玻璃」——本窗口所在场景里 UIVisualEffectView
// 的模糊采样始终失败（卡片只剩材质兜底灰、看不见壁纸），所以玻璃直接用
// 「桌面快照的模糊副本」绘制：布局时按卡片在屏幕中的位置从模糊全屏图上取景。
static UIImage *ERQuickAddBlurredImage(UIImage *image, CGFloat radius) {
    if (!image) return nil;
    @try {
        CIImage *input = [[CIImage alloc] initWithImage:image];
        if (!input) return image;
        CIFilter *filter = [CIFilter filterWithName:@"CIGaussianBlur"];
        if (!filter) return image;
        [filter setValue:input forKey:kCIInputImageKey];
        [filter setValue:@(radius) forKey:kCIInputRadiusKey];
        CIImage *output = filter.outputImage;
        if (!output) return image;
        output = [output imageByCroppingToRect:input.extent];
        static CIContext *context = nil;
        static dispatch_once_t once;
        dispatch_once(&once, ^{ context = [CIContext contextWithOptions:nil]; });
        CGImageRef cg = [context createCGImage:output fromRect:input.extent];
        if (!cg) return image;
        UIImage *blurred = [UIImage imageWithCGImage:cg scale:image.scale orientation:image.imageOrientation];
        CGImageRelease(cg);
        return blurred ?: image;
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 blur EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
        return image;
    }
}

// 1.0.8-23：即时隐藏 3D Touch 菜单视图（含容器）——不等待系统淡出动画。
// 扫描所有窗口的视图树，把类名含 ContextMenu / MenuPlatter 的可见视图临时隐藏；
// 1.2 秒后若它们仍挂在窗口上则恢复（系统正常流程会在此之前把它们移除）。
static NSMutableArray<UIView *> *gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews = nil;
static void ERQuickAddHideMenuOverlays(void) {
    @try {
        if (!gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews) gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews = [NSMutableArray array];
        NSMutableArray<UIView *> *stack = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (UIWindow *w in [UIApplication sharedApplication].windows) {
            if (w == gERQuickAddSheetWindow || w == gERQuickAddRenameWindow) continue;
            if (w.rootViewController.view) [stack addObject:w.rootViewController.view];
        }
        NSUInteger hiddenCount = 0;
        while (stack.count) {
            UIView *v = stack.lastObject;
            [stack removeLastObject];
            if (!v || v.hidden) continue;
            NSString *cls = NSStringFromClass([v class]) ?: @"";
            if ([cls containsString:@"ContextMenu"] || [cls containsString:@"MenuPlatter"]) {
                v.hidden = YES;
                [gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews addObject:v];
                hiddenCount++;
                continue;   // 整棵子树跳过
            }
            for (UIView *sub in v.subviews) [stack addObject:sub];
        }
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 hide menu overlays: %lu view(s)", (unsigned long)hiddenCount);
        if (hiddenCount > 0) {
            dispatch_after(dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(1.2 * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                           dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{
                for (UIView *v in gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews ?: @[]) {
                    @try { if (v.window) v.hidden = NO; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
                }
                [gERQuickAddHiddenMenuViews removeAllObjects];
            });
        }
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 hide overlays EXC %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
    }
}

// 1.0.8-20 · 修复①：主动关闭图标的 3D Touch（长按）菜单 ——
// 日志实锤：菜单窗口渲染层级高于 100，会盖在面板之上（表现为"点击后菜单不消失"）。
// 1.0.8-21：dismissMenu 走了但无效（SBIconView 的菜单并非由该 interaction 控制），
// 追加「方法名探测 + 逐一调用」：对 iconView / 主屏 rootVC / SBIconController 上
// 名字含 dismiss|hide|cancel 且含 menu|context 的**无参方法**逐个 @try 调用，
// 并把 0 参菜单相关方法名一次性写进日志（供下一轮精确收敛）。
static void ERQuickAddProbeMenuSelectorsOn(id target, NSString *tag) {
    if (!target) return;
    Class cls = [target class];
    if (!cls) return;
    static NSMutableSet<NSString *> *dumped = nil;
    if (!dumped) dumped = [NSMutableSet set];
    NSString *clsName = NSStringFromClass(cls) ?: @"?";
    if (![dumped containsObject:clsName]) {
        [dumped addObject:clsName];
        unsigned int count = 0;
        Method *methods = class_copyMethodList(cls, &count);
        NSMutableArray<NSString *> *hits = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (unsigned int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
            // 1.0.8-22：诊断用全量名单（**含带参数签名**）——上一版只记无参方法，
            // 真正的关闭接口很可能带参数，导致名单里看不到它。
            NSString *name = NSStringFromSelector(method_getName(methods[i]));
            NSString *lower = name.lowercaseString;
            if ([lower containsString:@"menu"] || [lower containsString:@"context"]) {
                [hits addObject:name];
            }
        }
        free(methods);
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu-surface[%@] %@ all=%lu %@",
                  tag, clsName, (unsigned long)hits.count, hits);
    }
    unsigned int count = 0;
    Method *methods = class_copyMethodList(cls, &count);
    for (unsigned int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
        SEL sel = method_getName(methods[i]);
        NSString *name = NSStringFromSelector(sel);
        if ([name containsString:@":"]) continue;
        NSString *lower = name.lowercaseString;
        if (!([lower containsString:@"dismiss"] || [lower containsString:@"hide"] ||
              [lower containsString:@"cancel"])) continue;
        if (!([lower containsString:@"menu"] || [lower containsString:@"context"])) continue;
        if (![target respondsToSelector:sel]) continue;
        @try {
            ((void (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(target, sel);
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu-dismiss try %@ -%@", clsName, name);
        } @catch (NSException *e) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu-dismiss EXC %@ -%@ %@", clsName, name, e.reason);
        }
    }
    free(methods);
}

static void ERQuickAddDismissContextMenu(id iconView) {
    @try {
        UIView *view = [iconView isKindOfClass:[UIView class]] ? (UIView *)iconView : nil;
        while (view) {
            for (id interaction in view.interactions) {
                if ([interaction isKindOfClass:[UIContextMenuInteraction class]]) {
                    [(UIContextMenuInteraction *)interaction dismissMenu];
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu dismissed via UIContextMenuInteraction on %@",
                              NSStringFromClass([view class]));
                    view = nil;
                    break;
                }
            }
            if (!view) break;
            view = view.superview;
        }
    } @catch (NSException *e) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu EXC(interaction) %@ -- %@", e.name, e.reason);
    }
    for (NSString *key in @[@"contextMenuInteraction", @"_contextMenuInteraction",
                            @"contextMenuController", @"_contextMenuController",
                            @"contextMenuViewController", @"_contextMenuViewController",
                            @"contextMenuPresentationController", @"_contextMenuPresentationController",
                            @"contextMenuView", @"_contextMenuView"]) {
        id obj = nil;
        @try { obj = [iconView valueForKey:key]; } @catch (__unused NSException *e) { obj = nil; }
        if (!obj || obj == iconView) continue;
        @try {
            if ([obj isKindOfClass:[UIContextMenuInteraction class]]) {
                [(UIContextMenuInteraction *)obj dismissMenu];
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu dismissed via kvc %@", key);
                continue;
            }
            if ([obj respondsToSelector:@selector(dismissMenu)]) {
                ((void (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(obj, @selector(dismissMenu));
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu dismissed via %@ -dismissMenu", key);
                continue;
            }
            if ([obj respondsToSelector:@selector(dismissViewControllerAnimated:completion:)]) {
                ((void (*)(id, SEL, BOOL, id))objc_msgSend)(obj, @selector(dismissViewControllerAnimated:completion:), YES, nil);
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu dismissed via %@ dismissViewController", key);
                continue;
            }
            ERQuickAddProbeMenuSelectorsOn(obj, [@"kvc:" stringByAppendingString:key]);
        } @catch (NSException *e) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu EXC(kvc %@) %@ -- %@", key, e.name, e.reason);
        }
    }
    @try {
        for (UIWindow *w in [UIApplication sharedApplication].windows) {
            UIViewController *vc = w.rootViewController;
            while (vc.presentedViewController) {
                UIViewController *presented = vc.presentedViewController;
                NSString *cls = NSStringFromClass([presented class]) ?: @"";
                if ([cls containsString:@"Menu"]) {
                    [presented dismissViewControllerAnimated:YES completion:nil];
                    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu dismissed via presented %@", cls);
                    return;
                }
                vc = presented;
            }
        }
    } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
    // 1.0.8-21：无参菜单方法的探测与调用（iconView / 主屏 rootVC / SBIconController）
    @try {
        ERQuickAddProbeMenuSelectorsOn(iconView, @"iconView");
        UIView *iconAsView = [iconView isKindOfClass:[UIView class]] ? (UIView *)iconView : nil;
        if (iconAsView.window.rootViewController) {
            ERQuickAddProbeMenuSelectorsOn(iconAsView.window.rootViewController, @"homeRootVC");
        }
        Class controllerClass = NSClassFromString(@"SBIconController");
        if (controllerClass && [controllerClass respondsToSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)]) {
            ERQuickAddProbeMenuSelectorsOn(((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(controllerClass, @selector(sharedInstance)),
                                           @"SBIconController");
        }
    } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 context menu: probes done");
}

static void ERQuickAddPresentRenameDialog(void (^onConfirm)(NSString *name)) {
    if (gERQuickAddRenameWindow) {   // 清理可能残留的旧窗口
        gERQuickAddRenameWindow.hidden = YES;
        gERQuickAddRenameWindow.rootViewController = nil;
        gERQuickAddRenameWindow = nil;
    }
    ERQuickAddRenameController *renameVC = [[ERQuickAddRenameController alloc] init];
    renameVC.onConfirm = onConfirm;
    UIWindowScene *scene = ERQuickAddMainScene();
    UIWindow *host = scene ? [[UIWindow alloc] initWithWindowScene:scene]
                           : [[UIWindow alloc] initWithFrame:[UIScreen mainScreen].bounds];
    host.frame = [UIScreen mainScreen].bounds;
    host.backgroundColor = UIColor.clearColor;
    host.opaque = NO;
    host.windowLevel = 100.0;   // 与主面板一致（层级已锁定，不再改动）
    host.rootViewController = renameVC;
    gERQuickAddRenameWindow = host;
    [host makeKeyAndVisible];
    ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 rename dialog window level=%.1f key=%d scene=%@",
              host.windowLevel, (int)host.isKeyWindow,
              scene ? NSStringFromClass(scene.class) : @"(none)");
}

static void ERQuickAddShowPickerForIconView(id iconView) {
    @try {
        // v14 修复①：先把 3D Touch 菜单关掉（它渲染层级高于本面板，不关会盖在面板上）
        ERQuickAddDismissContextMenu(iconView);
        SBIcon *icon = [iconView respondsToSelector:@selector(icon)] ? ((SBIcon *(*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(iconView, @selector(icon)) : nil;
        if (!icon) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 picker: icon view has no icon");
            return;
        }
        id controller = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(%c(SBIconController), @selector(sharedInstance));
        if (!controller) return;
        id model = nil;
        if ([controller respondsToSelector:@selector(iconModel)]) {
            model = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(controller, @selector(iconModel));
        }
        if (!model) model = [controller valueForKey:@"iconModel"];
        if (!model) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 picker: no icon model");
            return;
        }
        id root = [model respondsToSelector:@selector(rootFolder)] ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(model, @selector(rootFolder)) : nil;
        NSMutableArray *folderIcons = [NSMutableArray array];
        // 1.0.7-21（添加到文件夹 · 点击无反应）：旧代码只走 `[root valueForKey:@"_folders"]`。
        // 实机日志（v1.0.7-20）逐字：`picker EXC NSUnknownKeyException -- [<SBRootFolder>
        // valueForUndefinedKey:]: this class is not key value coding-compliant for the key
        // _folders` —— 本机 SBRootFolder 没有 `_folders` 这个 KVC 键，@try 兜住后选择
        // 面板直接不弹，用户看到的就是「点击「添加到文件夹」没有任何反应」。
        // 修法：按可用性多级降采样，每级先 respondsToSelector / @try 探测：
        //   ① 根文件夹的 `folders` 选择器（SBFolder 系的标准取文件夹入口）
        //   ② KVC `folders`
        //   ③ 各列表模型（lists / iconLists / listModel）里的图标 —— 根页上的文件夹
        //      本来就以 SBFolderIcon 的形式存在于列表里，这一级不依赖任何私有 KVC 键。
        // 全失败才走「还没有任何文件夹」空面板。
        NSArray *folders = nil;
        NSString *via = @"none";
        if (root) {
            SEL selFolders = NSSelectorFromString(@"folders");
            if ([root respondsToSelector:selFolders]) {
                @try {
                    id value = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(root, selFolders);
                    if ([value isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] && [value count]) {
                        folders = value;
                        via = @"selector folders";
                    }
                } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
            }
            if (!folders) {
                @try {
                    id value = [root valueForKey:@"folders"];
                    if ([value isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] && [value count]) {
                        folders = value;
                        via = @"kvc folders";
                    }
                } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
            }
            if (!folders) {
                NSMutableArray *lists = [NSMutableArray array];
                for (NSString *key in @[@"lists", @"iconLists"]) {
                    @try {
                        id value = [root valueForKey:key];
                        if ([value isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]]) [lists addObjectsFromArray:value];
                    } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
                }
                @try {
                    id single = [root valueForKey:@"listModel"];
                    if (single) [lists addObject:single];
                } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
                NSMutableArray *collected = [NSMutableArray array];
                for (id list in lists) {
                    id icons = nil;
                    @try { icons = [list valueForKey:@"icons"]; } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
                    if (![icons isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] &&
                        [list respondsToSelector:@selector(icons)]) {
                        icons = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(list, @selector(icons));
                    }
                    for (id item in [icons isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] ? icons : @[]) {
                        if ([item isKindOfClass:%c(SBFolderIcon)] && ![collected containsObject:item]) {
                            [collected addObject:item];
                        }
                    }
                }
                if (collected.count) {
                    folders = collected;
                    via = @"list models";
                }
            }
        }
        for (id item in [folders isKindOfClass:[NSArray class]] ? folders : @[]) {
            if ([item isKindOfClass:%c(SBFolderIcon)] && ![folderIcons containsObject:item]) {
                [folderIcons addObject:item];
            }
        }
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 picker: %lu folder(s) via %@",
                  (unsigned long)folderIcons.count, via);
        if (!folderIcons.count) {
            UIAlertController *empty = [UIAlertController alertControllerWithTitle:@"添加到文件夹"
                                                                           message:@"还没有任何文件夹"
                                                                    preferredStyle:UIAlertControllerStyleAlert];
            [empty addAction:[UIAlertAction actionWithTitle:@"好" style:UIAlertActionStyleDefault handler:nil]];
            UIViewController *presenter = [UIApplication sharedApplication].keyWindow.rootViewController;
            while (presenter.presentedViewController) presenter = presenter.presentedViewController;
            [presenter presentViewController:empty animated:YES completion:nil];
            return;
        }
        // 1.0.7-28：底部出现、且整体停在 dock 上方（自绘面板，见 ERQuickAddSheetController）。
        NSMutableArray<NSString *> *rowTitles = [NSMutableArray array];
        NSMutableArray<NSString *> *subtitles = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (id folderIcon in folderIcons) {
            NSString *title = nil;
            if ([folderIcon respondsToSelector:@selector(displayName)]) {
                title = ((NSString *(*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(folderIcon, @selector(displayName));
            }
            if (title.length == 0 && [folderIcon respondsToSelector:@selector(folder)]) {
                id folder = ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(folderIcon, @selector(folder));
                if ([folder respondsToSelector:@selector(displayName)]) {
                    title = ((NSString *(*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(folder, @selector(displayName));
                }
            }
            [rowTitles addObject:(title ?: @"文件夹")];
            // 1.0.8-14：计数与取名同循环完成，iconModel 与显示名一并传给探测函数
            [subtitles addObject:ERQuickAddFolderSubtitle(folderIcon, model, title)];
        }
        ERQuickAddSheetController *sheet = [[ERQuickAddSheetController alloc] init];
        sheet.titles = rowTitles;
        sheet.subtitles = subtitles;
        // 1.0.8-5：文件夹图标同样**运行时**取（取不到由面板用系统 folder 图形兜底），
        // 这里绝不写死任何文件夹名/图标。
        sheet.onCreateFolder = ^(NSString *folderName) {
            ERQuickAddCreateFolderAndMoveIcon(icon, folderName);
        };
        NSArray<id> *folderList = [folderIcons copy];
        sheet.onPick = ^(NSInteger index) {
            if (index < 0 || index >= (NSInteger)folderList.count) return;
            id folderIcon = folderList[(NSUInteger)index];
            NSString *rowTitle = rowTitles[(NSUInteger)index];
            @try {
                    // 1.0.7-26：iOS 17.2.1 实机日志证明 SBIconController 与 iconModel
                    // 都不再响应 addIcons:intoFolderIcon:…（“点了没反应”的真正收尾点）。
                    // 这里不再猜选择器，改成运行时发现：先把候选目标里所有含
                    // "Folder" / "addIcon" 的方法名打进日志，再逐个尝试调用第一个命中的。
                    NSMutableArray<id> *targets = [NSMutableArray array];
                    void (^addTarget)(id) = ^(id obj) { if (obj && ![targets containsObject:obj]) [targets addObject:obj]; };
                    addTarget(controller);
                    addTarget(model);
                    for (NSString *key in @[@"iconManager", @"_iconManager"]) {
                        @try { addTarget([controller valueForKey:key]); } @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
                    }
                    Class managerClass = NSClassFromString(@"SBIconManager");
                    if (managerClass && [managerClass respondsToSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)]) {
                        @try { addTarget(((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(managerClass, @selector(sharedInstance))); }
                        @catch (__unused NSException *e) {}
                    }
                    static BOOL apiDumped = NO;
                    if (!apiDumped) {
                        apiDumped = YES;
                        for (id candidate in targets) {
                            unsigned int methodCount = 0;
                            Method *methods = class_copyMethodList([candidate class], &methodCount);
                            NSMutableArray<NSString *> *hits = [NSMutableArray array];
                            for (unsigned int i = 0; i < methodCount; i++) {
                                NSString *name = NSStringFromSelector(method_getName(methods[i]));
                                if ([name containsString:@"Folder"] || [name containsString:@"addIcon"]) [hits addObject:name];
                            }
                            free(methods);
                            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 api-dump cls=%@ count=%u hits=%@",
                                       NSStringFromClass([candidate class]), methodCount, hits);
                        }
                    }
                    NSArray<NSString *> *selectorNames = @[
                        @"addIcons:intoFolderIcon:openFolderOnFinish:completion:",
                        @"addIcons:intoFolderIcon:openFolderOnFinish:complete:",
                        @"addIcons:intoFolderIcon:openFolderOnFinish:",
                        @"addIcons:intoFolderIcon:",
                        @"addIcon:intoFolderIcon:openFolderOnFinish:completion:",
                        @"addIcon:intoFolderIcon:" ];
                    BOOL invoked = NO;
                    for (id candidate in targets) {
                        for (NSString *name in selectorNames) {
                            SEL sel = NSSelectorFromString(name);
                            if (![candidate respondsToSelector:sel]) continue;
                            @try {
                                NSMethodSignature *sig = [candidate methodSignatureForSelector:sel];
                                if (!sig) continue;
                                NSInvocation *inv = [NSInvocation invocationWithMethodSignature:sig];
                                inv.selector = sel;
                                NSArray *icons = @[icon];
                                id folder = folderIcon;
                                [inv setArgument:&icons atIndex:2];
                                [inv setArgument:&folder atIndex:3];
                                if (sig.numberOfArguments > 4) { BOOL open = NO; [inv setArgument:&open atIndex:4]; }
                                if (sig.numberOfArguments > 5) { id completion = nil; [inv setArgument:&completion atIndex:5]; }
                                [inv invokeWithTarget:candidate];
                                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 moved via %@ %@ into %@",
                                           NSStringFromClass([candidate class]), name, rowTitle);
                                invoked = YES;
                                break;
                            } @catch (NSException *e) {
                                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 move EXC %@ via %@ %@",
                                           e.reason, NSStringFromClass([candidate class]), name);
                            }
                        }
                        if (invoked) break;
                    }
                    if (!invoked) ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 move: no target/selector on %lu candidate(s)",
                                            (unsigned long)targets.count);
            } @catch (NSException *exception) {
                ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 move EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
            }
        };
        UIViewController *presenter = [UIApplication sharedApplication].keyWindow.rootViewController;
        // 1.0.7-25：iOS 15+ 多场景下 keyWindow 可能为 nil —— 那样 present 会静默失败，
        // 表现正是「点了添加到文件夹没有任何反应」。这里按可见窗口兜底取一个。
        if (!presenter) {
            for (UIWindow *window in [UIApplication sharedApplication].windows) {
                if (window.hidden || window.alpha < 0.01) continue;
                if (window.rootViewController) { presenter = window.rootViewController; break; }
            }
        }
        while (presenter.presentedViewController) presenter = presenter.presentedViewController;
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 picker host=%@ folders=%lu",
                  presenter ? NSStringFromClass(presenter.class) : @"(nil)",
                  (unsigned long)folderList.count);
        // 1.0.7-31：放进更高层级的窗口 —— 面板盖在 dock 上面（而不是绕开它）。
        [sheet presentOverDock];
    } @catch (NSException *exception) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 picker EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
    }
}

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.7-29 · 底部组件 —— 音乐胶囊（LSMusicCapsule 移植）
//
// 位置：锁屏底部「手电筒 ↔ 相机」之间的水平中心（默认参数就落在那一行）。
// 结构：[圆形封面] [歌名 / 歌手] [圆形播放键]
// 视觉：毛玻璃 + 低透明度浅灰 + 0.5px 白描边 + even-odd 内阴影 + 白色外发光。
// 数据：MediaRemote 私有框架（运行时 dlopen/dlsym，不参与链接）；回退 SBMediaController。
//
// 源工程 LSMusicCapsule 的类名 / 函数名在此统一加 ERMusic 前缀 —— 同一台设备上若还
// 装着独立的 LSMusicCapsule，两边同名类会在 SpringBoard 里撞车。
// 设置入口：根页面「锁屏控制项」组 →「底部组件」子页（BottomComponents.plist）。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
static NSString *const kERMusicCapsuleEnabledKey = @"MusicCapsule.Enabled";
static NSString *const kERMusicCapsuleInsetKey   = @"MusicCapsule.WidthInset";
static NSString *const kERMusicCapsuleOffsetKey  = @"MusicCapsule.OffsetY";
static NSString *const kERMusicCapsuleHeightKey  = @"MusicCapsule.Height";
static NSString *const kERMusicCapsuleHideSystemKey = @"MusicCapsule.HideSystemNowPlaying";

#pragma mark - 音乐胶囊 · MediaRemote（运行时解析）

typedef void (^ERMusicNowPlayingBlock)(NSDictionary *info);

static void *(*ERMusic_MRGetNowPlayingInfo)(dispatch_queue_t, ERMusicNowPlayingBlock) = NULL;
static void  (*ERMusic_MRSendCommand)(int, NSDictionary *, void (^)(NSError *)) = NULL;
static void  (*ERMusic_MRRegisterForNowPlayingNotifications)(dispatch_queue_t) = NULL;

// MRMediaRemoteCommand：TogglePlayPause == 2
static const int kERMusicCommandTogglePlayPause = 2;

static NSString *const kERMusicMRTitle       = @"kMRMediaRemoteNowPlayingInfoTitle";
static NSString *const kERMusicMRArtist      = @"kMRMediaRemoteNowPlayingInfoArtist";
static NSString *const kERMusicMRArtworkData = @"kMRMediaRemoteNowPlayingInfoArtworkData";
static NSString *const kERMusicMRRate        = @"kMRMediaRemoteNowPlayingInfoPlaybackRate";
static NSString *const kERMusicMRInfoDidChange    = @"kMRMediaRemoteNowPlayingInfoDidChangeNotification";
static NSString *const kERMusicMRPlayingDidChange = @"kMRMediaRemoteApplicationIsPlayingDidChangeNotification";

static void ERMusicResolveMediaRemote(void) {
    static dispatch_once_t onceToken;
    dispatch_once(&onceToken, ^{
        void *handle = dlopen("/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/MediaRemote.framework/MediaRemote", RTLD_NOW);
        if (!handle) handle = dlopen("/System/Library/Frameworks/MediaRemote.framework/MediaRemote", RTLD_NOW);
        if (!handle) return;
        ERMusic_MRGetNowPlayingInfo =
            (void *(*)(dispatch_queue_t, ERMusicNowPlayingBlock))dlsym(handle, "MRMediaRemoteGetNowPlayingInfo");
        ERMusic_MRSendCommand =
            (void (*)(int, NSDictionary *, void (^)(NSError *)))dlsym(handle, "MRMediaRemoteSendCommand");
        ERMusic_MRRegisterForNowPlayingNotifications =
            (void (*)(dispatch_queue_t))dlsym(handle, "MRMediaRemoteRegisterForNowPlayingNotifications");
        if (ERMusic_MRRegisterForNowPlayingNotifications) {
            ERMusic_MRRegisterForNowPlayingNotifications(dispatch_get_main_queue());
        }
    });
}

#pragma mark - 音乐胶囊 · 视图

@interface ERMusicCapsuleView : UIControl
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIView             *clipView;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIVisualEffectView *blurView;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIView             *tintView;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIImageView        *artworkView;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UILabel            *titleLabel;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UILabel            *artistLabel;
@property (nonatomic, strong) UIButton           *playPauseButton;
@property (nonatomic, assign) BOOL               playing;
@property (nonatomic, assign) CGFloat            capsuleHeight;
- (void)setTitleText:(NSString *)title
          artistText:(NSString *)artist
             artwork:(UIImage *)artwork
             playing:(BOOL)playing;
@end

// 柔和内阴影：even-odd 环形路径 + 圆角遮罩，只保留胶囊内部的一圈
static void ERMusicInstallInnerShadow(UIView *host, CGFloat radius) {
    for (CALayer *layer in [host.layer.sublayers copy]) {
        if ([layer.name isEqualToString:@"ERMusicInnerShadow"]) { [layer removeFromSuperlayer]; }
    }

    CAShapeLayer *shadow = [CAShapeLayer layer];
    shadow.name = @"ERMusicInnerShadow";
    shadow.frame = host.bounds;

    CGFloat bleed = 24.0;
    CGRect outer = CGRectInset(host.bounds, -bleed, -bleed);
    UIBezierPath *path = [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRect:outer];
    UIBezierPath *inner = [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:host.bounds cornerRadius:radius];
    [path appendPath:inner];
    path.usesEvenOddFillRule = YES;

    shadow.path = path.CGPath;
    shadow.fillRule = kCAFillRuleEvenOdd;
    shadow.fillColor = [UIColor clearColor].CGColor;
    shadow.shadowColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:1.0].CGColor;
    shadow.shadowOpacity = 0.16;
    shadow.shadowRadius = 5.0;
    shadow.shadowOffset = CGSizeMake(0, 1);

    CAShapeLayer *mask = [CAShapeLayer layer];
    mask.frame = host.bounds;
    mask.path = [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:host.bounds cornerRadius:radius].CGPath;
    shadow.mask = mask;

    [host.layer addSublayer:shadow];
}

@implementation ERMusicCapsuleView {
    CGRect _lastInnerBounds;
}

- (instancetype)initWithFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    self = [super initWithFrame:frame];
    if (!self) { return nil; }

    self.backgroundColor = [UIColor clearColor];
    self.capsuleHeight = 56.0;

    // 外层：白色外发光（不裁剪，阴影才画得出来）
    self.layer.shadowColor = [UIColor whiteColor].CGColor;
    self.layer.shadowOpacity = 0.22;
    self.layer.shadowRadius = 14.0;
    self.layer.shadowOffset = CGSizeMake(0, 0);

    // 内层：圆角裁剪，承载毛玻璃
    UIView *clip = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:self.bounds];
    clip.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    clip.backgroundColor = [UIColor clearColor];
    clip.layer.cornerRadius = self.capsuleHeight / 2.0;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) { clip.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous; }
    clip.clipsToBounds = YES;
    clip.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [self addSubview:clip];
    self.clipView = clip;

    UIBlurEffect *effect = [UIBlurEffect effectWithStyle:UIBlurEffectStyleRegular];
    UIVisualEffectView *blur = [[UIVisualEffectView alloc] initWithEffect:effect];
    blur.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    blur.frame = clip.bounds;
    blur.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [clip addSubview:blur];
    self.blurView = blur;

    UIView *tint = [[UIView alloc] initWithFrame:clip.bounds];
    tint.autoresizingMask = UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleWidth | UIViewAutoresizingFlexibleHeight;
    tint.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:0.92 alpha:0.12];
    tint.userInteractionEnabled = NO;
    [clip addSubview:tint];
    self.tintView = tint;

    // 极细白色半透明描边（画在裁剪层之上，避免被裁掉）
    CAShapeLayer *border = [CAShapeLayer layer];
    border.name = @"ERMusicBorder";
    border.fillColor = [UIColor clearColor].CGColor;
    border.strokeColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.22].CGColor;
    border.lineWidth = 0.5;
    [self.layer addSublayer:border];

    // 内容：封面
    UIImageView *art = [[UIImageView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectMake(12, 8, 40, 40)];
    art.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleAspectFill;
    art.clipsToBounds = YES;
    art.layer.cornerRadius = 20.0;
    if (@available(iOS 13.0, *)) { art.layer.cornerCurve = kCACornerCurveContinuous; }
    art.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.10];
    art.image = [UIImage systemImageNamed:@"music.note"];
    art.tintColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.75];
    [self addSubview:art];
    self.artworkView = art;

    // 内容：两行文字
    UILabel *title = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    title.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:15.0 weight:UIFontWeightSemibold];
    title.textColor = [UIColor whiteColor];
    title.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentLeft;
    title.lineBreakMode = NSLineBreakByTruncatingTail;
    [self addSubview:title];
    self.titleLabel = title;

    UILabel *artist = [[UILabel alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectZero];
    artist.font = [UIFont systemFontOfSize:13.0 weight:UIFontWeightRegular];
    artist.textColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.62];
    artist.textAlignment = NSTextAlignmentLeft;
    artist.lineBreakMode = NSLineBreakByTruncatingTail;
    [self addSubview:artist];
    self.artistLabel = artist;

    // 内容：圆形半透明播放/暂停按钮
    UIButton *button = [UIButton buttonWithType:UIButtonTypeCustom];
    button.frame = CGRectZero;
    button.backgroundColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.18];
    button.layer.cornerRadius = 18.0;
    button.layer.borderWidth = 0.5;
    button.layer.borderColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.25].CGColor;
    UIImage *icon = [UIImage systemImageNamed:@"pause.fill"];
    [button setImage:[icon imageWithRenderingMode:UIImageRenderingModeAlwaysTemplate]
            forState:UIControlStateNormal];
    button.tintColor = [UIColor whiteColor];
    button.adjustsImageWhenHighlighted = YES;
    [button addTarget:self action:@selector(erMusicTogglePlayPause:) forControlEvents:UIControlEventTouchUpInside];
    [self addSubview:button];
    self.playPauseButton = button;

    return self;
}

- (void)layoutSubviews {
    [super layoutSubviews];

    CGFloat h = self.bounds.size.height;
    CGFloat w = self.bounds.size.width;
    CGFloat r = h / 2.0;

    self.clipView.frame = self.bounds;
    self.clipView.layer.cornerRadius = r;
    self.blurView.frame = self.clipView.bounds;
    self.tintView.frame = self.clipView.bounds;

    for (CALayer *layer in self.layer.sublayers) {
        if ([layer.name isEqualToString:@"ERMusicBorder"]) {
            ((CAShapeLayer *)layer).frame = self.bounds;
            ((CAShapeLayer *)layer).path =
                [UIBezierPath bezierPathWithRoundedRect:self.bounds cornerRadius:r].CGPath;
        }
    }

    // 内阴影只在尺寸变化时重建（锁屏滚动时 layoutSubviews 会被高频调用）
    if (!CGRectEqualToRect(_lastInnerBounds, self.clipView.bounds)) {
        _lastInnerBounds = self.clipView.bounds;
        ERMusicInstallInnerShadow(self.clipView, r);
    }

    CGFloat artSize = h - 16.0;
    self.artworkView.frame = CGRectMake(12.0, 8.0, artSize, artSize);
    self.artworkView.layer.cornerRadius = artSize / 2.0;

    CGFloat btnSize = 36.0;
    self.playPauseButton.frame = CGRectMake(w - btnSize - 10.0, (h - btnSize) / 2.0, btnSize, btnSize);
    self.playPauseButton.layer.cornerRadius = btnSize / 2.0;

    CGFloat textX = CGRectGetMaxX(self.artworkView.frame) + 10.0;
    CGFloat textW = MAX(20.0, CGRectGetMinX(self.playPauseButton.frame) - textX - 10.0);
    self.titleLabel.frame  = CGRectMake(textX, 10.0, textW, 19.0);
    self.artistLabel.frame = CGRectMake(textX, 29.0, textW, 17.0);
}

- (void)setTitleText:(NSString *)title
          artistText:(NSString *)artist
             artwork:(UIImage *)artwork
             playing:(BOOL)playing {
    self.titleLabel.text  = title.length  ? title  : @"未在播放";
    self.artistLabel.text = artist.length ? artist : @"";

    if (artwork) {
        self.artworkView.image = artwork;
        self.artworkView.tintColor = nil;
        self.artworkView.contentMode = UIViewContentModeScaleAspectFill;
    } else {
        self.artworkView.image =
            [[UIImage systemImageNamed:@"music.note"] imageWithRenderingMode:UIImageRenderingModeAlwaysTemplate];
        self.artworkView.tintColor = [UIColor colorWithWhite:1.0 alpha:0.75];
        self.artworkView.contentMode = UIViewContentModeCenter;
    }

    self.playing = playing;
    NSString *name = playing ? @"pause.fill" : @"play.fill";
    UIImage *icon = [[UIImage systemImageNamed:name] imageWithRenderingMode:UIImageRenderingModeAlwaysTemplate];
    [self.playPauseButton setImage:icon forState:UIControlStateNormal];
}

- (void)erMusicTogglePlayPause:(id)sender {
    ERMusicResolveMediaRemote();
    if (ERMusic_MRSendCommand) {
        ERMusic_MRSendCommand(kERMusicCommandTogglePlayPause, nil, nil);
    } else {
        Class mediaControllerClass = NSClassFromString(@"SBMediaController");
        if ([mediaControllerClass respondsToSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)]) {
#pragma clang diagnostic push
#pragma clang diagnostic ignored "-Warc-performSelector-leaks"
            id mediaController = [mediaControllerClass performSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)];
            if ([mediaController respondsToSelector:@selector(togglePlayPause)]) {
                [mediaController performSelector:@selector(togglePlayPause)];
            }
#pragma clang diagnostic pop
        }
    }
    UIImpactFeedbackGenerator *generator =
        [[UIImpactFeedbackGenerator alloc] initWithStyle:UIImpactFeedbackStyleLight];
    [generator impactOccurred];
}

// 胶囊空白处不拦截触摸，透传给下层锁屏
- (UIView *)hitTest:(CGPoint)point withEvent:(UIEvent *)event {
    UIView *view = [super hitTest:point withEvent:event];
    if (view == self) { return nil; }
    return view;
}

@end

#pragma mark - 音乐胶囊 · 管理器

static void ERMusicPrefsChangedCallback(CFNotificationCenterRef center, void *observer,
                                        CFStringRef name, const void *object,
                                        CFDictionaryRef userInfo);

@interface ERMusicCapsuleManager : NSObject
@property (nonatomic, strong) ERMusicCapsuleView *capsule;
@property (nonatomic, weak)   UIView *hostView;
@property (nonatomic, weak)   UIView *quickActionsView;
@property (nonatomic, assign) BOOL hasContent;
@property (nonatomic, assign) BOOL enabled;
@property (nonatomic, assign) BOOL hideSystemNowPlaying;
@property (nonatomic, strong) NSArray<UIView *> *systemNowPlayingViews;
- (void)applySystemNowPlayingHiddenInRoot:(UIView *)root;   // 1.0.8-35：补上声明（原来只有实现，调用点会告警）
@property (nonatomic, weak)   UIViewController *coverSheetController;
@property (nonatomic, assign) CGFloat widthInset;
@property (nonatomic, assign) CGFloat offsetY;
@property (nonatomic, assign) CGFloat capsuleHeight;
+ (instancetype)shared;
- (void)reloadPrefs;
- (void)attachToCoverSheetView:(UIView *)view;
- (void)setVisible:(BOOL)visible animated:(BOOL)animated;
- (void)refresh;
@end

@implementation ERMusicCapsuleManager {
    CFTimeInterval _prefsLoadedAt;
}

+ (instancetype)shared {
    static ERMusicCapsuleManager *manager;
    static dispatch_once_t onceToken;
    dispatch_once(&onceToken, ^{ manager = [[ERMusicCapsuleManager alloc] init]; });
    return manager;
}

- (instancetype)init {
    self = [super init];
    if (!self) { return nil; }

    self.capsule = [[ERMusicCapsuleView alloc] initWithFrame:CGRectMake(0, 0, 240, 56)];
    self.capsule.alpha = 0.0;
    self.capsule.hidden = YES;

    _widthInset = 88.0;
    _offsetY = 0.0;
    _capsuleHeight = 56.0;
    [self reloadPrefs];

    ERMusicResolveMediaRemote();
    NSNotificationCenter *center = [NSNotificationCenter defaultCenter];
    [center addObserver:self selector:@selector(refresh) name:kERMusicMRInfoDidChange object:nil];
    [center addObserver:self selector:@selector(refresh) name:kERMusicMRPlayingDidChange object:nil];
    [center addObserver:self
               selector:@selector(erMusicApplicationDidBecomeActive)
                   name:UIApplicationDidBecomeActiveNotification
                 object:nil];

    // 1.0.7-29：本插件统一的偏好变更通知 —— 设置页改完立即生效，无需注销。
    CFNotificationCenterAddObserver(CFNotificationCenterGetDarwinNotifyCenter(),
                                    NULL,
                                    ERMusicPrefsChangedCallback,
                                    (__bridge CFStringRef)kERReloadNotification,
                                    NULL,
                                    CFNotificationSuspensionBehaviorDeliverImmediately);
    return self;
}

- (void)reloadPrefs {
    self.enabled = ERPreferenceBool(kERMusicCapsuleEnabledKey, NO);
    self.widthInset = ERPreferenceDouble(kERMusicCapsuleInsetKey, 88.0);
    self.offsetY = ERPreferenceDouble(kERMusicCapsuleOffsetKey, 0.0);
    self.capsuleHeight = ERPreferenceDouble(kERMusicCapsuleHeightKey, 56.0);
    self.hideSystemNowPlaying = ERPreferenceBool(kERMusicCapsuleHideSystemKey, YES);
    _prefsLoadedAt = CACurrentMediaTime();
}

// 锁屏滚动时 viewDidLayoutSubviews 每帧都来 —— 偏好值最多每秒重读一次。
- (void)reloadPrefsIfStale {
    if (CACurrentMediaTime() - _prefsLoadedAt < 1.0) return;
    [self reloadPrefs];
}

- (void)erMusicApplicationDidBecomeActive {
    [self reloadPrefs];
    [self refresh];
}

// 在视图树里找锁屏底部快捷按钮容器（类名含 QuickActions）
- (UIView *)findQuickActionsIn:(UIView *)root {
    if (!root) return nil;
    NSMutableArray<UIView *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:root];
    NSUInteger head = 0;
    NSUInteger guard = 0;
    while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 400) {
        UIView *candidate = queue[head++];
        if ([NSStringFromClass(candidate.class) rangeOfString:@"QuickActions"].location != NSNotFound) {
            return candidate;
        }
        if (candidate.subviews.count) { [queue addObjectsFromArray:candidate.subviews]; }
    }
    return nil;
}

- (void)attachToCoverSheetView:(UIView *)view {
    if (!view) return;
    [self reloadPrefsIfStale];

    // 1.0.8-33 · 「隐藏系统锁屏音乐」是**独立开关**，必须放在 enabled 判断**之前**。
    //
    // 旧的写法第一句就是 `if (!self.enabled) { … return; }` —— 而「音乐胶囊」总开关
    // 默认**关**，于是这一行永远提前返回，下面的 `applySystemNowPlayingHiddenInRoot:`
    // 一次都执行不到。1.0.8-31 我只改了 shouldHide 的与/或，改在了**它后面**，
    // 所以那次修完依旧「没有效果」。现在把隐藏提到最前面：只要开关开着就执行，
    // 与胶囊本体是否显示无关（用户可以只藏系统的、不放我们自己的胶囊）。
    [self applySystemNowPlayingHiddenInRoot:view];

    if (!self.enabled) { [self setVisible:NO animated:NO]; return; }

    // 已定位过且仍挂在窗口上就复用，避免每次布局都做整棵树遍历
    UIView *quickActions = self.quickActionsView;
    if (!(quickActions && quickActions.window && quickActions.superview)) {
        quickActions = [self findQuickActionsIn:view];
        self.quickActionsView = quickActions;
        static BOOL loggedLookup = NO;
        if (!loggedLookup) {
            loggedLookup = YES;
            if (quickActions) {
                ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 quickactions=%@ super=%@",
                           NSStringFromClass(quickActions.class),
                           NSStringFromClass(quickActions.superview.class));
            } else {
                ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 quickactions NOT found in %@",
                           NSStringFromClass(view.class));
            }
        }
    }

    // 1.0.7-30：坐标系问题修复。
    //
    // 原来把胶囊挂到 quickActions.superview 并用 quickActions.center 定位。实机报告
    // 「胶囊出现在屏幕正中间」—— 说明那次命中的容器并不是屏幕底部那一行，或它的
    // 坐标系不是全屏。这里改成：**一律挂在锁屏根视图上、一律用根视图坐标**，
    // 底部锚定为默认（手电筒/相机行就在底部安全区上方约 46pt），
    // 只有当 QuickActions 容器**确实落在屏幕下半部**时才采信它的中心。
    UIView *host = view;
    if (!host) return;

    if (self.capsule.superview != host) {
        [self.capsule removeFromSuperview];
        [host addSubview:self.capsule];
        [host bringSubviewToFront:self.capsule];
    }
    self.hostView = host;

    CGFloat screenW = host.bounds.size.width;
    CGFloat screenH = host.bounds.size.height;
    CGFloat height = MAX(44.0, self.capsuleHeight);
    CGFloat width = screenW - 2.0 * self.widthInset;
    width = MIN(340.0, MAX(180.0, width));

    self.capsule.bounds = CGRectMake(0, 0, width, height);
    self.capsule.capsuleHeight = height;

    CGFloat safeBottom = host.safeAreaInsets.bottom;
    CGFloat centerY = screenH - safeBottom - 46.0 + self.offsetY;   // 默认：手电筒/相机那一行
    BOOL usedQuickActions = NO;
    if (quickActions) {
        CGRect qaRect = [quickActions convertRect:quickActions.bounds toView:host];
        CGFloat candidate = CGRectGetMidY(qaRect) + self.offsetY;
        if (qaRect.size.height > 4.0 && candidate > screenH * 0.55 && candidate < screenH - 6.0) {
            centerY = candidate;
            usedQuickActions = YES;
        }
    }

    self.capsule.center = CGPointMake(screenW / 2.0, centerY);
    [self.capsule setNeedsLayout];

    [self applySystemNowPlayingHiddenInRoot:host];

    static BOOL loggedPlacement = NO;
    if (!loggedPlacement) {
        loggedPlacement = YES;
        CGRect qaRect = quickActions ? [quickActions convertRect:quickActions.bounds toView:host] : CGRectZero;
        ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 place host=%@ screen=%.0fx%.0f y=%.1f viaQA=%d qa={%.0f,%.0f,%.0fx%.0f} safe=%.0f",
                   NSStringFromClass(host.class), screenW, screenH, centerY, (int)usedQuickActions,
                   qaRect.origin.x, qaRect.origin.y, qaRect.size.width, qaRect.size.height, safeBottom);
    }
}

// 1.0.7-31 · 系统锁屏音乐定位：**控制器树 + 视图树**双扫描。
//
// 1.0.7-30 只按「视图类名」找，实机反馈「没有效果」—— 最可能的原因是那块组件的
// 类名在**控制器**上（例如 CSMediaControlsViewController，而它的 view 就是普通 UIView），
// 视图类名里根本没有 MediaControls / NowPlaying 字样。现在两条路都走：
//   ① 控制器树：类名含 MediaControls / NowPlaying → 取它的 view；
//   ② 视图树：类名命中且尺寸合理（高 > 40、宽 > 80）→ 取最外层。
// 命中的**所有**候选一起隐藏；开关关闭即恢复。一个都找不到时打印现场清单
// （控制器名列表 + 中下部大视图名列表），下一次日志即可定名。
static BOOL ERMusicClassLooksLikeSystemNowPlaying(NSString *name) {
    if (!name.length) return NO;
    // 1.0.8-36 · **回退 1.0.8-34 的 `hasPrefix:@"MRU"` / `MediaRemote`**。
    //
    // 那两个前缀把范围放得太宽，直接导致 1.0.8-34 / 1.0.8-35 装完「卡在注销界面」：
    //   · MRU 是 MediaRemoteUI 的公共前缀，里面既有那条小播放条，也有**容器类**；
    //   · 配合「尺寸只有下限（>40 且 >80）」和「命中即停止下探（取最外层）」
    //     → 被藏掉的是**最大那个 MRU 容器**，于是锁屏整块消失，看起来就是进不去系统。
    //
    // 而且这两个前缀本来就是多余的：iOS 17 那条真正的播放条叫 **MRUNowPlayingView**，
    // 名字里**本来就含 `NowPlaying`**，原有那条判断已经能命中它。
    // 所以这里逐字回到 1.0.8-33 的匹配表 —— 那一版连续两次证明能正常开机。
    return [name rangeOfString:@"MediaControls"].location != NSNotFound ||
           [name rangeOfString:@"NowPlaying"].location != NSNotFound;
}

/// 1.0.8-36 · 隐藏对象的**尺寸闸门**：只允许「像一条播放条」的视图。
///
/// 原代码只有下限（height > 40 && width > 80），没有上限 —— 于是全屏 430×932 的容器
/// 也能通过。这里是结构性的安全网：**任何比这条更大的东西一律不碰**，
/// 不管类名怎么变（系统换版本、类名重构）都不会再出现「把整屏藏掉」这种事。
/// 锁屏那条播放条的实测尺寸是 339×75，远在这个上限之内。
static BOOL ERMusicViewLooksLikeNowPlayingBar(UIView *view) {
    if (!view) return NO;
    CGFloat width = CGRectGetWidth(view.bounds);
    CGFloat height = CGRectGetHeight(view.bounds);
    if (height < 40.0 || width < 80.0) return NO;                 // 下限（原来的条件）
    if (height > kERMusicNowPlayingBarMaxHeight) return NO;       // 上限：太高 → 一定是容器
    CGFloat screenWidth = CGRectGetWidth(UIScreen.mainScreen.bounds);
    if (screenWidth > 0.0 && width > screenWidth - 40.0) return NO; // 上限：太宽 → 一定是容器
    return YES;
}

- (NSArray<UIView *> *)systemNowPlayingCandidatesInRoot:(UIView *)root {
    NSMutableArray<UIView *> *candidates = [NSMutableArray array];

    UIViewController *controlRoot = self.coverSheetController;
    if (controlRoot) {
        NSMutableArray<UIViewController *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:controlRoot];
        NSUInteger head = 0, guard = 0;
        while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 400) {
            UIViewController *controller = queue[head++];
            if (ERMusicClassLooksLikeSystemNowPlaying(NSStringFromClass(controller.class))) {
                UIView *view = controller.view;
                // 1.0.8-36：控制器命中也必须过尺寸闸门 —— 否则会把整页的 view 藏掉
                if (view && ERMusicViewLooksLikeNowPlayingBar(view) && ![candidates containsObject:view]) {
                    [candidates addObject:view];
                }
            }
            [queue addObjectsFromArray:controller.childViewControllers];
            if (controller.presentedViewController) [queue addObject:controller.presentedViewController];
        }
    }

    if (root) {
        NSMutableArray<UIView *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:root];
        NSUInteger head = 0, guard = 0;
        while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 1200) {
            UIView *candidate = queue[head++];
            if ([candidate isKindOfClass:[ERMusicCapsuleView class]]) continue;   // 绝不碰自己的胶囊
            // 1.0.8-36：类名 + **尺寸上下限**双闸门（原来只有下限，会把全屏容器一起藏掉）
            if (ERMusicClassLooksLikeSystemNowPlaying(NSStringFromClass(candidate.class)) &&
                ERMusicViewLooksLikeNowPlayingBar(candidate)) {
                if (![candidates containsObject:candidate]) [candidates addObject:candidate];
                continue;   // 命中即不再下探，避免父子重复
            }
            if (candidate.subviews.count) [queue addObjectsFromArray:candidate.subviews];
        }
    }
    return candidates;
}

- (BOOL)anySystemNowPlayingTargetAlive {
    for (UIView *view in self.systemNowPlayingViews) { if (view.window) return YES; }
    return NO;
}

- (void)dumpSystemNowPlayingDiagnosticsInRoot:(UIView *)root {
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    // 1.0.8-39 · 诊断版重写。
    //
    // 原来那份 dump 有两个毛病，导致它几乎没用（20260920-0458 的日志就是证据）：
    //   ① 尺寸过滤读的是 `candidate.frame` —— 那是**父视图坐标系**，所以全屏容器的
    //      frame 永远显示 (0,0 430x932)，一层层打出来全是同一个坐标，看不出层级；
    //   ② 过滤条件是「高 ≥ 40 且 宽 ≥ 150」，全屏容器全部通过，40 条上限被它们占满，
    //      真正的小控件（音乐条）反而被挤掉了。
    //
    // 现在改成：
    //   · 统一用 convertRect:toView:window 换算到**窗口坐标**（每一条都是"屏幕上长在哪"）；
    //   · 过滤成「控件尺寸」：宽 150–420、高 18–400 —— 全屏容器（高 932）自然被排除，
    //     而锁屏音乐条（实测 339×75）一定落在范围内；
    //   · 顺手带上 hidden 标记与窗口清单（判断音乐是不是在另一个窗口/进程里）；
    //   · 最多打 3 次（首次锁屏可能没播音乐，后续锁屏还能再记一次）。
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    // 1.0.8-40：改成「最多 8 次、间隔 ≥3 秒」。
    // 1.0.8-39 是"最多 3 次"，而锁屏的布局回调会在极短时间内连着触发 —— 三次配额
    // 一瞬间就用光了，抓到的是锁屏还在位移、媒体位还是空占位（CSProminentEmptyElementView）
    // 的那一刻（那份日志里所有 Y 都是负的 -863/-722，就是证据）。
    // 现在按时间摊开，后面几次就能抓到"音乐已经在播、锁屏已停稳"的状态。
    static NSUInteger dumpCount = 0;
    static CFTimeInterval lastDumpAt = 0.0;
    CFTimeInterval dumpNow = CACurrentMediaTime();
    if (dumpCount >= 8) return;
    if (dumpNow - lastDumpAt < 3.0) return;
    lastDumpAt = dumpNow;
    dumpCount++;

    NSMutableArray<NSString *> *windows = [NSMutableArray array];
    for (UIWindow *w in ERAllApplicationWindows()) {
        [windows addObject:[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@(lvl=%.0f %.0fx%.0f %@%@)",
                            NSStringFromClass(w.class), w.windowLevel,
                            CGRectGetWidth(w.bounds), CGRectGetHeight(w.bounds),
                            w.hidden ? @"hid" : @"vis", w.isKeyWindow ? @" key" : @""]];
    }
    ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 dump windows=%@", windows);

    NSMutableArray<NSString *> *controllerNames = [NSMutableArray array];
    UIViewController *controlRoot = self.coverSheetController;
    if (controlRoot) {
        NSMutableArray<UIViewController *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:controlRoot];
        NSUInteger head = 0, guard = 0;
        while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 400 && controllerNames.count < 60) {
            UIViewController *controller = queue[head++];
            [controllerNames addObject:NSStringFromClass(controller.class)];
            [queue addObjectsFromArray:controller.childViewControllers];
            if (controller.presentedViewController) [queue addObject:controller.presentedViewController];
        }
    }
    ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 dump vcs=%@", controllerNames);

    if (!root) return;
    UIWindow *window = root.window;
    NSMutableArray<NSString *> *entries = [NSMutableArray array];
    NSMutableArray<UIView *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:root];
    NSUInteger head = 0, guard = 0;
    while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 1500 && entries.count < 80) {
        UIView *candidate = queue[head++];
        CGRect r = window ? [candidate convertRect:candidate.bounds toView:window] : candidate.frame;
        if (r.size.width >= 150.0 && r.size.width <= 420.0 &&
            r.size.height >= 18.0 && r.size.height <= 400.0) {
            [entries addObject:[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@(%.0f,%.0f %.0fx%.0f%@)",
                                NSStringFromClass(candidate.class),
                                r.origin.x, r.origin.y, r.size.width, r.size.height,
                                candidate.hidden ? @" HID" : @""]];
        }
        if (candidate.subviews.count) [queue addObjectsFromArray:candidate.subviews];
    }
    ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 dump widget-sized views(窗口坐标)=%@", entries);
}

- (void)applySystemNowPlayingHiddenInRoot:(UIView *)root {
    NSArray<UIView *> *targets = self.systemNowPlayingViews;
    if (!targets.count || ![self anySystemNowPlayingTargetAlive]) {
        targets = [self systemNowPlayingCandidatesInRoot:root];
        self.systemNowPlayingViews = targets;
        // 1.0.8-36：改成**每次扫描都记**（原来只记一次）。这条日志是定位「藏了什么」
        // 唯一的一手证据 —— 上一次就是靠它的缺席才反推出匹配表有问题。
        // 它只在「目标为空 或 目标已失效」时才走到，不会被 layoutSubviews 高频刷屏。
        if (targets.count) {
            NSMutableArray<NSString *> *names = [NSMutableArray array];
            for (UIView *view in targets) [names addObject:NSStringFromClass(view.class)];
            ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 system-nowplaying targets=%@", names);
        }
        if (!targets.count) {
            [self dumpSystemNowPlayingDiagnosticsInRoot:root];
            return;
        }
    }
    // 1.0.8-31：原来这里写的是 `self.enabled && self.hideSystemNowPlaying` ——
    // 「音乐胶囊」总开关默认**关**，所以只开了「隐藏系统锁屏音乐」的用户根本藏不掉
    // 系统自带的那块音乐，这就是「打开没有效果」的根因。
    // 修法：把「隐藏系统锁屏音乐」当成独立开关 —— 只要它开着就藏，与胶囊本体是否
    // 显示无关（用户可以只藏系统的、不放我们自己的胶囊）。
    BOOL shouldHide = self.hideSystemNowPlaying;
    for (UIView *view in targets) {
        if (view.hidden == shouldHide) continue;
        view.hidden = shouldHide;
        ERLogInfo(@"MUSICCAPSULE ver=1.0.9-103 system-nowplaying %@ (cls=%@)",
                   shouldHide ? @"hidden" : @"restored", NSStringFromClass(view.class));
    }
}

- (void)setVisible:(BOOL)visible animated:(BOOL)animated {
    if (visible && (!self.enabled || !self.hasContent)) { visible = NO; }

    // 已是目标状态就直接返回 —— 逐帧的布局路径不会堆叠重复动画
    CGFloat target = visible ? 1.0 : 0.0;
    if (self.capsule.hidden == !visible && fabs(self.capsule.alpha - target) < 0.01) { return; }

    if (visible) { self.capsule.hidden = NO; }
    [UIView animateWithDuration:(animated ? 0.28 : 0.0)
                          delay:0
                        options:UIViewAnimationOptionAllowUserInteraction
                     animations:^{
        self.capsule.alpha = visible ? 1.0 : 0.0;
    } completion:^(BOOL finished) {
        if (!visible) { self.capsule.hidden = YES; }
    }];
}

- (void)refresh {
    [self reloadPrefsIfStale];
    if (!self.enabled) { [self setVisible:NO animated:YES]; return; }

    __weak typeof(self) weakSelf = self;
    ERMusicResolveMediaRemote();

    void (^apply)(NSDictionary *) = ^(NSDictionary *info) {
        NSString *title  = info[kERMusicMRTitle];
        NSString *artist = info[kERMusicMRArtist];
        NSNumber *rate   = info[kERMusicMRRate];
        NSData *artData  = info[kERMusicMRArtworkData];

        UIImage *image = nil;
        if (artData.length) { image = [UIImage imageWithData:artData]; }

        BOOL playing = rate ? ([rate doubleValue] > 0.01) : NO;
        weakSelf.hasContent = (title.length > 0);

        [weakSelf.capsule setTitleText:title artistText:artist artwork:image playing:playing];
        [weakSelf setVisible:weakSelf.hasContent animated:YES];
    };

    if (ERMusic_MRGetNowPlayingInfo) {
        ERMusic_MRGetNowPlayingInfo(dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^(NSDictionary *info) {
            dispatch_async(dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{ apply(info); });
        });
        return;
    }

    // 回退：SBMediaController（仅文本，无封面）
    NSString *title = nil, *artist = nil;
    Class mediaControllerClass = NSClassFromString(@"SBMediaController");
    if ([mediaControllerClass respondsToSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)]) {
#pragma clang diagnostic push
#pragma clang diagnostic ignored "-Warc-performSelector-leaks"
        id mediaController = [mediaControllerClass performSelector:@selector(sharedInstance)];
        if ([mediaController respondsToSelector:NSSelectorFromString(@"nowPlayingTitle")]) {
            title = [mediaController performSelector:NSSelectorFromString(@"nowPlayingTitle")];
        }
        if ([mediaController respondsToSelector:NSSelectorFromString(@"nowPlayingArtist")]) {
            artist = [mediaController performSelector:NSSelectorFromString(@"nowPlayingArtist")];
        }
#pragma clang diagnostic pop
    }
    apply(@{ kERMusicMRTitle: title ?: @"", kERMusicMRArtist: artist ?: @"" });
}

@end

static void ERMusicPrefsChangedCallback(CFNotificationCenterRef center, void *observer,
                                        CFStringRef name, const void *object,
                                        CFDictionaryRef userInfo) {
    dispatch_async(dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{
        ERMusicCapsuleManager *manager = [ERMusicCapsuleManager shared];
        [manager reloadPrefs];
        [manager refresh];
        UIView *host = manager.hostView;
        if (host && host.window) [manager attachToCoverSheetView:host];
        [manager setVisible:manager.enabled && manager.hasContent animated:NO];
    });
}

#pragma mark - 音乐胶囊 · Hooks

@interface CSCoverSheetViewController : UIViewController
@end

%hook CSCoverSheetViewController

- (void)viewDidAppear:(BOOL)animated {
    %orig;
    if (!gEnabled) return;
    ERMusicCapsuleManager *manager = [ERMusicCapsuleManager shared];
    manager.coverSheetController = self;
    [manager reloadPrefs];
    // 1.0.8-36 · **撤销 1.0.8-34 在这里加的提前隐藏调用**。
    //
    // 那句让隐藏逻辑在「锁屏一出现」就跑（注销后第一屏就是锁屏），叠加当时过宽的
    // MRU 前缀匹配，直接把锁屏容器藏掉 → 卡在注销界面。这里恢复到 1.0.8-33 的时序：
    // 隐藏只经由下面的 attachToCoverSheetView:（以及 viewDidLayoutSubviews 那条）执行，
    // 与连续两次证明可开机的那一版逐字一致。
    if (!manager.enabled) { [manager setVisible:NO animated:NO]; return; }

    UIView *coverSheetView = self.view;
    [manager attachToCoverSheetView:coverSheetView];
    [manager refresh];
    // 1.0.9 · **锁屏音乐探针**（只读）：全窗口扫描类名含 Music/NowPlaying/MRU/Media/
    // Player/Artwork 的视图，记录「类名 + 窗口坐标 + 所属窗口」。锁屏隐藏音乐一直
    // 找不到目标 —— 这份清单能回答：音乐组件到底在不在本进程、类名是什么、在哪个窗口。
    // 10 秒限流一次；只记录不修改。
    @try {
        static CFTimeInterval gERMusProbeLast = 0.0;
        CFTimeInterval musNow = CACurrentMediaTime();
        if (musNow - gERMusProbeLast >= 10.0) {
            gERMusProbeLast = musNow;
            NSMutableArray<NSString *> *found = [NSMutableArray array];
            NSArray<NSString *> *keys = @[@"Music", @"NowPlaying", @"MRU", @"Media", @"Player", @"Artwork", @"NowPlaying"];
            for (UIWindow *window in ERAllApplicationWindows()) {
                if (window.hidden || window.alpha < 0.02) continue;
                NSMutableArray<UIView *> *queue = [NSMutableArray arrayWithObject:window];
                NSUInteger head = 0, guard = 0;
                while (head < queue.count && guard++ < 4000 && found.count < 24) {
                    UIView *view = queue[head++];
                    NSString *name = NSStringFromClass(view.class);
                    BOOL hit = NO;
                    for (NSString *kw in keys) {
                        if ([name containsString:kw]) { hit = YES; break; }
                    }
                    if (hit) {
                        CGRect wr = [view convertRect:view.bounds toView:window];
                        [found addObject:[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@(%.0f,%.0f %.0fx%.0f)@%@%@",
                                          name, CGRectGetMinX(wr), CGRectGetMinY(wr),
                                          CGRectGetWidth(wr), CGRectGetHeight(wr),
                                          NSStringFromClass(window.class),
                                          view.hidden ? @" HID" : @""]];
                    }
                    if (view.subviews.count) [queue addObjectsFromArray:view.subviews];
                }
            }
            ERLogInfo(@"MUS-PROBE 锁屏音乐相关视图=%@", found.count ? found : @"(全窗口未找到 —— 音乐组件在别的进程渲染)");
        }
    } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
    // 锁屏视图树可能尚未布局完成，0.35s 后复查一次（原工程行为）
    __weak UIView *weakView = coverSheetView;
    dispatch_after(dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(0.35 * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                   dispatch_get_main_queue(), ^{
        UIView *view = weakView;
        if (!view) return;
        ERMusicCapsuleManager *inner = [ERMusicCapsuleManager shared];
        [inner attachToCoverSheetView:view];
        [inner refresh];
    });
}

- (void)viewWillDisappear:(BOOL)animated {
    %orig;
    [[ERMusicCapsuleManager shared] setVisible:NO animated:NO];
}

- (void)viewDidLayoutSubviews {
    %orig;
    if (!gEnabled) return;
    ERMusicCapsuleManager *manager = [ERMusicCapsuleManager shared];
    if (!manager.coverSheetController) manager.coverSheetController = self;
    [manager attachToCoverSheetView:self.view];
}

%end

%hook SBApplication

// 1.0.7-16：注入点从 SBIconView **改为 SBApplication**。
// 1.0.7-14/15 hook 的 `-[SBIconView applicationShortcutItems]` 在实机上从未被调用
// （长按图标时一条 QUICKADD 都没有）——用户提供的 AddToFolder 参考包元数据里，
// `applicationShortcutItems` 是与 `applicationBundleIdentifier`、`displayName` 并列的
// SBApplication 选择器：快捷菜单的条目本来就是**按应用**取的。这里在系统条目
// **顶部**插入自建 item（type 识别），标题 = 设置页的名称设置。
- (NSArray *)applicationShortcutItems {
    NSArray *items = %orig;
    @try {
        if (!ERPreferenceBool(@"QuickAdd.Enabled", NO)) return items;
        NSString *name = ERQuickAddActionName();
        SBSApplicationShortcutItem *item = [[%c(SBSApplicationShortcutItem) alloc] init];
        if (!item) return items;
        item.type = kERQuickAddItemType;
        item.localizedTitle = name;
        NSMutableArray *list = [items mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableArray array];
        [list insertObject:item atIndex:0];
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 injected(app) name=%@ total=%lu", name, (unsigned long)list.count);
        return list;
    } @catch (NSException *exception) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 inject(app) EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
        return items;
    }
}

%end

%hook SBIconView

// 1.0.7-14 的注入点：实机上从未被调用，保留作为兜底（部分系统版本菜单条目
// 仍可能走视图层），日志带 (view) 后缀以便区分两条注入路径。
- (NSArray *)applicationShortcutItems {
    NSArray *items = %orig;
    @try {
        if (!ERPreferenceBool(@"QuickAdd.Enabled", NO)) return items;
        if (![self respondsToSelector:@selector(icon)]) return items;
        SBIcon *icon = ((SBIcon *(*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(self, @selector(icon));
        if (!icon) return items;
        if (![icon respondsToSelector:@selector(applicationBundleIdentifier)]) return items;
        NSString *name = ERQuickAddActionName();
        SBSApplicationShortcutItem *item = [[%c(SBSApplicationShortcutItem) alloc] init];
        if (!item) return items;
        item.type = kERQuickAddItemType;
        item.localizedTitle = name;
        NSMutableArray *list = [items mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableArray array];
        [list insertObject:item atIndex:0];
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 injected(view) name=%@", name);
        return list;
    } @catch (NSException *exception) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 inject(view) EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
        return items;
    }
}

// 1.0.7-17：**真正的注入点** —— UIContextMenuInteraction 的配置回调。
// 两条 applicationShortcutItems 路径在实机上都没有被调用过（SBApplication 与
// SBIconView 的 getter 都一条日志没有），而长按图标时这个回调必然触发：
// SBIconView 就是自己上下文菜单的 interaction delegate。做法：拿 %orig 的配置，
// 把它的 actionProvider 包一层，在菜单**最前面**插入「添加到文件夹」，
// 并过滤掉 shortcut-item 路径可能塞进来的同名项，保证不出现两行。
//
// 1.0.7-20 · **崩溃修复**（实机报告 SpringBoard-2026-09-17-220509）：
// 1.0.7-19 那版「用 suggestedActions 自建配置」把 identifier 与 previewProvider
// 都传了 nil，长按任意图标 → 直接安全模式，崩溃报告逐字如下：
//     EXC_CRASH / SIGABRT
//     NSInvalidArgumentException: -[__NSConcreteUUID identifier]:
//                                unrecognized selector sent to instance 0x2862c0b80
//     lastExceptionBacktrace:
//       -[SBIconView _contextMenuConfigurationWillPresent:forInteraction:]   (+128)
//       -[SBIconView contextMenuInteraction:willDisplayMenuForConfiguration:animator:]
//       -[UIContextMenuInteraction _delegate_contextMenuInteractionWillDisplayForConfiguration:]
// 读法：identifier 为 nil 时 UIKit 会给配置**补一个裸 NSUUID**，而 SpringBoardHome
// 在菜单呈现前把这个对象当作自己的「菜单标识」并对它发 -identifier —— 裸 NSUUID
// 不响应，于是抛异常、SpringBoard 自杀进安全模式。Apple 自家配置的 identifier 是
// SpringBoard 自己的对象，所以只有「我们自建的配置」会踩到。
// 修复口径：**原样带回** 原配置的 identifier 与 previewProvider，只包 actionProvider
//（即 1.0.7-18 的思路 —— 它当年只是编译不过，见下面的注释）。任何一步取不到
// 就原样返回，绝不构造半截配置。
- (UIContextMenuConfiguration *)contextMenuInteraction:(UIContextMenuInteraction *)interaction
                          configurationForMenuAtLocation:(CGPoint)location {
    UIContextMenuConfiguration *original = %orig;
    @try {
        // 1.0.7-25：进入日志（每秒最多一条）—— 判断长按菜单这条 hook 到底有没有被调用、
        // 以及「快速添加」开关当前是开是关。
        static CFTimeInterval quickAddMenuLoggedAt = 0.0;
        CFTimeInterval quickAddNow = CACurrentMediaTime();
        if (quickAddNow - quickAddMenuLoggedAt > 1.0) {
            quickAddMenuLoggedAt = quickAddNow;
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu-hook orig=%d enabled=%d name=%@",
                       original ? 1 : 0,
                       ERPreferenceBool(@"QuickAdd.Enabled", NO) ? 1 : 0,
                       ERQuickAddActionName());
        }
        if (!original) return original;
        if (!ERPreferenceBool(@"QuickAdd.Enabled", NO)) return original;
        NSString *name = ERQuickAddActionName();
        if (name.length == 0) return original;

        // Theos 的 iPhoneOS16.5 SDK 里 identifier / previewProvider / actionProvider
        // 三个属性声明不可见（property not found），一律走 objc_msgSend 动态调用；
        // @selector(identifier) 这种字面量还会撞 -Wundeclared-selector，所以要
        // NSSelectorFromString。
        SEL selIdentifier = NSSelectorFromString(@"identifier");
        SEL selPreview = NSSelectorFromString(@"previewProvider");
        SEL selActions = NSSelectorFromString(@"actionProvider");
        SEL make = NSSelectorFromString(@"configurationWithIdentifier:previewProvider:actionProvider:");
        id identifier = [original respondsToSelector:selIdentifier]
            ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(original, selIdentifier) : nil;
        id preview = [original respondsToSelector:selPreview]
            ? ((id (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(original, selPreview) : nil;

        // **硬闸门**：identifier 必须原样带回。取不到就什么都不做 —— 宁可这次
        // 菜单少一行，也绝不再把 SpringBoard 送进安全模式（代价完全不对称）。
        if (!identifier || ![(id)original.class respondsToSelector:make]) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu skipped (identifier=%@ factory=%d)",
                      identifier ? @"ok" : @"nil",
                      [(id)original.class respondsToSelector:make] ? 1 : 0);
            return original;
        }

        // ARC 下 block 调用的正确姿势：不能把 block 对象强转成函数指针
        //（1.0.7-18 的 `cast of an Objective-C pointer to 'UIMenu *(*)(...)' is
        // disallowed with ARC`），也不能把 id 桥接成 block 类型（1.0.7-19 前一版
        // 的 `incompatible types casting 'id' to 'UIMenu *(^)(...)'`）。给
        // objc_msgSend 本身定型即可：让它「返回」一个 block，拿到的就是块对象。
        typedef UIMenu *(^ERMenuProvider)(NSArray<UIMenuElement *> *);
        ERMenuProvider provider = nil;
        if ([original respondsToSelector:selActions]) {
            provider = ((ERMenuProvider (*)(id, SEL))objc_msgSend)(original, selActions);
        }

        __weak SBIconView *weakView = self;
        ERMenuProvider wrapped = ^UIMenu *(NSArray<UIMenuElement *> *suggestedActions) {
            UIMenu *base = provider ? provider(suggestedActions)
                                    : [UIMenu menuWithTitle:@"" children:suggestedActions ?: @[]];
            NSMutableArray<UIMenuElement *> *children = [NSMutableArray array];
            for (UIMenuElement *element in base.children ?: @[]) {
                if ([element isKindOfClass:[UIAction class]] &&
                    [((UIAction *)element).title isEqualToString:name]) {
                    continue;   // 去重：shortcut-item 路径塞进来的同名项跳过
                }
                [children addObject:element];
            }
            // identifier 也给一个固定串：不再留 nil 让 UIKit 自己补身份。
            UIAction *add = [UIAction actionWithTitle:name
                                                image:[UIImage systemImageNamed:@"folder.badge.plus"]
                                           identifier:kERQuickAddItemType
                                              handler:^(__unused UIAction *action) {
                // 1.0.8-23：即时关闭 —— 点按瞬间先把菜单视图藏起来（不再等淡出），
                // 再立即弹面板（速度回到"刚刚好"；快照因此也是干净的）。
                SBIconView *strongView = weakView;
                ERQuickAddHideMenuOverlays();
                ERQuickAddDismissContextMenu(strongView);
                ERQuickAddShowPickerForIconView(strongView);
            }];
            [children insertObject:add atIndex:0];
            return [UIMenu menuWithTitle:base.title ?: @"" children:children];
        };

        id rebuilt = ((id (*)(id, SEL, id, id, id))objc_msgSend)(original.class, make,
                                                                 identifier, preview, wrapped);
        // 最后一道保险：回来的必须是真配置，否则退回原样。
        if (![rebuilt isKindOfClass:[UIContextMenuConfiguration class]]) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu rejected: rebuilt=%@",
                      rebuilt ? NSStringFromClass([rebuilt class]) : @"nil");
            return original;
        }
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu injected name=%@", name);
        return rebuilt;
    } @catch (NSException *exception) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 menu EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
        return original;
    }
}

%end

%hook SBIconController

- (void)activateShortcut:(SBSApplicationShortcutItem *)shortcut
    withBundleIdentifier:(NSString *)bundleIdentifier
              forIconView:(SBIconView *)iconView {
    @try {
        if ([shortcut isKindOfClass:%c(SBSApplicationShortcutItem)] &&
            [shortcut.type isEqualToString:kERQuickAddItemType]) {
            ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 activated");
            // 1.0.8-23：与菜单路径一致 —— 即时隐藏菜单 + 立即弹面板（不再延迟）
            SBIconView *strongView = iconView;
            ERQuickAddHideMenuOverlays();
            ERQuickAddDismissContextMenu(strongView);
            ERQuickAddShowPickerForIconView(strongView);
            return;   // 自己的动作不交给系统
        }
    } @catch (NSException *exception) {
        ERLogInfo(@"QUICKADD ver=1.0.9-103 activate EXC %@ -- %@", exception.name, exception.reason);
    }
    %orig;
}

%end

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.7-27 · 横屏状态栏上移的「逐帧补写」。
//
// 023615 日志实锤：CCUIStatusBar / CCUIStatusLabel 的 transform 会被系统持续重置
// （verify 里 ty 在 0 与被移值之间来回翻），而同一棵树里的隐私指示头
// （CCUISensorAttributionPrivacyHeaderView）用「反算 rise + 反复补写」一直稳稳
// 落在 y 16.5。状态栏照搬同一套打法：在这两条带各自的 -layoutSubviews 里，
// 系统每次重排完就把上移补回去 —— 视觉上即「稳定停在 16.5」。
// 1.0.7-28 · 状态栏位移的目标选择。
//
// 023615 日志：可见那条带（CCUIStatusBar，a=1.0/hid=0）挂在 SBControlCenterWindow，
// 而它的 transform 在两次写入之间被系统反复重置 —— 直接写叶子追不上。
// 改为优先平移它的外层容器（HeaderPocket / 顶层匿名容器），容器不由系统逐帧驱动。
static UIView *ERLandscapeStatusChromeTarget(UIView *view) {
    if (!view) return nil;
    // 1.0.8-1 修正：**绝不再把位移落到 HeaderPocket 上**。
    //
    // 181245 日志证明这条路是错的：目标是 pocket 时，那条计划把 **pocket 的顶边**
    // 顶到了 16.5（class=CCUIHeaderPocketView ... winY=16.5），而真正可见的状态带
    // 在 pocket 内部还低 43.7pt —— 于是「容器顶边到位」了，带子反而被整体下移，
    // 用户看到的仍然是「状态栏没上去」。而 pocket 还会被控制中心反复重建，基准量一次
    // 漂一次（rise 6.8→23.3→39.8→56.3→72.8 递增）。
    //
    // 正确做法与隐私指示头那条**能正常上移**的路径一致：位移落在「包裹这条带的那层
    // 容器」上，且容器必须与带同尺度 —— 不能是连材质背景、操作按钮一起装进去的 pocket。
    CGRect bandBounds = view.bounds;
    UIView *parent = view.superview;
    NSInteger depth = 0;
    while (parent && depth < 4) {
        NSString *name = NSStringFromClass(parent.class);
        if ([name containsString:@"HeaderPocket"] || [name containsString:@"Window"]) break;
        CGFloat parentHeight = CGRectGetHeight(parent.bounds);
        BOOL sameScale = parentHeight > 1.0 &&
                         parentHeight <= CGRectGetHeight(bandBounds) + 10.0 &&
                         CGRectGetWidth(parent.bounds) >= CGRectGetWidth(bandBounds) * 0.9;
        if (sameScale) return parent;
        parent = parent.superview;
        depth++;
    }
    return view;
}

// 1.0.7-28 · 位移的「节奏补写」（20Hz）。
// 系统会在两次写入之间重置这条带的 transform，单靠 layoutSubviews 后补写可能赶不上。
// 这里在「横屏 + CC 呈现」期间以 20Hz 对**上次命中的目标视图**重新贴位移
// （缓存视图、不重新遍历视图树，成本极低），直到 CC 收起 / 转回竖屏。
static dispatch_source_t gERChromeReassertTimer = nil;
static NSMapTable<UIView *, NSNumber *> *gERChromeReassertRises = nil;

// 1.0.8-58 · 恢复这个判定（-54 清理时误删）：状态栏行成员（CCUIStatusBar/
// CCUIStatusLabel/STUIStatusBar_Wrapper）现在由钉死钩子（setFrame:）持有，
// 20Hz 重写不得再碰它们 —— 否则陈旧登记的 rise 会把行拖回老位置。
static BOOL ERStatusBarRowOwned(NSString *name) {
    return [name isEqualToString:@"CCUIStatusBar"] ||
           [name isEqualToString:@"CCUIStatusLabel"] ||
           [name isEqualToString:@"STUIStatusBar_Wrapper"];
}

static void ERStopLandscapeChromeReassert(void) {
    if (gERChromeReassertTimer) {
        dispatch_source_cancel(gERChromeReassertTimer);
        gERChromeReassertTimer = nil;
    }
    [gERChromeReassertRises removeAllObjects];
}

static void ERChromeReassertRegisterView(UIView *view, CGFloat rise) {
    if (!view) return;
    if (!gERChromeReassertRises) gERChromeReassertRises = [NSMapTable weakToStrongObjectsMapTable];
    [gERChromeReassertRises setObject:@(rise) forKey:view];
}

static void ERStartLandscapeChromeReassertIfNeeded(void) {
    if (gERChromeReassertTimer) return;
    if (!gERChromeReassertRises) gERChromeReassertRises = [NSMapTable weakToStrongObjectsMapTable];
    dispatch_source_t timer = dispatch_source_create(DISPATCH_SOURCE_TYPE_TIMER, 0, 0, dispatch_get_main_queue());
    dispatch_source_set_timer(timer,
                              dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(0.05 * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                              (uint64_t)(0.05 * NSEC_PER_SEC),
                              (uint64_t)(0.01 * NSEC_PER_SEC));
    dispatch_source_set_event_handler(timer, ^{
        if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented || !ERLandscapePresentationActive()) {
            ERStopLandscapeChromeReassert();
            return;
        }
        NSMutableArray<UIView *> *dead = [NSMutableArray array];
        for (UIView *view in gERChromeReassertRises.keyEnumerator) {
            NSNumber *rise = [gERChromeReassertRises objectForKey:view];
            if (!view.window) { [dead addObject:view]; continue; }
            // 1.0.8-58 · 状态栏行成员改由钉死钩子（setFrame:）持有，重写不再碰它们
            if (ERStatusBarRowOwned(NSStringFromClass(view.class))) {
                [dead addObject:view];
                continue;
            }
            [[EchoRebornCoordinator shared] applyLandscapeRise:rise.doubleValue toView:view];
        }
        for (UIView *view in dead) [gERChromeReassertRises removeObjectForKey:view];
    });
    dispatch_resume(timer);
    gERChromeReassertTimer = timer;
}

// 1.0.7-27：Logos 对未声明的类默认按 NSObject 处理，self 传不进 UIView * 参数
// （首次构建在 22657 行报 incompatible pointer type）。这里补上正确父类的声明 ——
// 只做编译期类型检查，不引用类符号（%hook 走 objc_getClass 运行时查找），
// 因此不会产生链接期的 Undefined symbols。
@interface CCUIStatusBar : UIView
@end

@interface STUIStatusBar_Wrapper : UIView
@end

// 1.0.8-59 · 权限胶囊（相机/麦克风/定位指示）的探针：与状态栏行探针同款 ——
// 在胶囊被 setFrame: 的瞬间记录调用栈，定位它的布局来源。只读、3 秒限流。
@interface CCUISensorAttributionCompactControl : UIView
@end

@interface CCUISensorAttributionPrivacyHeaderView : UIView
@end

static CFTimeInterval gERSTUIProbeLast = 0.0;
static void ERSTUIProbeLog(UIView *view, const char *hook) {
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented) return;
    if (!ERLandscapePresentationActive()) return;
    CFTimeInterval now = CACurrentMediaTime();
    if (now - gERSTUIProbeLast < 3.0) return;      // 3 秒一条，避免刷屏
    gERSTUIProbeLast = now;
    UIWindow *hostWindow = view.window;
    CGRect windowRect = hostWindow ? [view convertRect:view.bounds toView:hostWindow] : CGRectZero;
    ERLogInfo(@"STUI-PROBE %@ cls=%@ win=%@ frame=(%.1f,%.1f %.0fx%.0f) transform=(a=%.2f,b=%.2f,tx=%.2f,ty=%.2f)\n  调用栈:\n%@",
              [NSString stringWithUTF8String:hook], NSStringFromClass(view.class),
              hostWindow ? NSStringFromClass(hostWindow.class) : @"(无窗口)",
              CGRectGetMinY(windowRect), CGRectGetMinX(windowRect),
              CGRectGetWidth(windowRect), CGRectGetHeight(windowRect),
              view.transform.a, view.transform.b, view.transform.tx, view.transform.ty,
              [NSThread callStackSymbols]);
}

// 1.0.8-60 · 竖屏 CC 顶部两个操作按钮（编辑/电源）的探针：
// 权限胶囊出现时它们会被系统布局下移 —— 先探明类名与写入者，下一版再钉死。
// 过滤条件：控制中心已呈现 + SBControlCenterWindow + 顶部 120pt 内的方形按钮。
static CFTimeInterval gEROpBtnProbeLast = 0.0;
static void EROpButtonProbeLog(UIView *view, const char *hook) {
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented) return;
    if (!view.window || ![NSStringFromClass(view.window.class) containsString:@"ControlCenter"]) return;
    CGRect w = view.frame;
    if (w.size.width < 30.0 || w.size.width > 60.0 || w.size.height < 30.0 || w.size.height > 60.0) return;
    CGRect wr = [view convertRect:view.bounds toView:view.window];
    if (CGRectGetMinY(wr) > 140.0) return;
    CFTimeInterval now = CACurrentMediaTime();
    if (now - gEROpBtnProbeLast < 3.0) return;
    gEROpBtnProbeLast = now;
    ERLogInfo(@"OPBTN-PROBE %@ cls=%@ win=(%.1f,%.1f %.0fx%.0f) ty=%.1f\n  调用栈:\n%@",
              [NSString stringWithUTF8String:hook], NSStringFromClass(view.class),
              CGRectGetMinX(wr), CGRectGetMinY(wr), CGRectGetWidth(wr), CGRectGetHeight(wr),
              view.transform.ty, [NSThread callStackSymbols]);
}

%hook UIButton
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    EROpButtonProbeLog(self, "UIButton setFrame:");
    %orig(frame);
}
%end

%hook CCUISensorAttributionCompactControl
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    // 1.0.8-60 · 源头拦截：胶囊位置由系统布局经 setFrame: 写入（探针 0041 证实），
    // 在写入的那一刻叠加「权限胶囊偏移」，与系统无对抗。
    if (gEnabled && gERControlCenterPresented && ERLandscapePresentationActive()
        && frame.size.width > 1.0) {
        CGFloat off = ERLandscapePillOffset();
        if (off != 0.0) frame.origin.y += off;
    }
    %orig(frame);
    ERSTUIProbeLog(self, "pill setFrame:");
}
%end

%hook CCUISensorAttributionPrivacyHeaderView
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    if (gEnabled && gERControlCenterPresented && ERLandscapePresentationActive()
        && frame.size.width > 1.0) {
        CGFloat off = ERLandscapePillOffset();
        if (off != 0.0) frame.origin.y += off;
    }
    %orig(frame);
    ERSTUIProbeLog(self, "pillheader setFrame:");
}
%end

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.0.8-55 · **布局来源探针**（只读，不写任何东西）。
//
// 目的：横屏 CC 里那条状态栏行（运营商/时间/电量）的位置归系统管，我们事后写
// transform 会被系统覆盖（-44~48 的教训）。要做成，必须知道**系统是在哪个方法里
// 写位置的** —— 拿到那个「写入者」，在源头 hook 才能一次做对。
//
// 做法：在这条行的 setFrame:/layoutSubviews 被调用的瞬间，把**调用栈**写进日志。
// 调用栈会逐帧列出「谁调用了它」，栈上靠近系统层的那个类+方法，就是我们要 hook
// 的布局来源。只记录、不修改，绝无副作用；3 秒限一条，不刷日志。
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

%hook STUIStatusBar_Wrapper
// 1.0.8-56 · **源头拦截** —— 探针（20260920-2218）证实：这条行的位置是
// ControlCenterUI 的布局通过 -[STUIStatusBar_Wrapper setFrame:] 写入的
//（frame=(43.7,107.0 825x44)，transform=identity）。
// 在 setFrame: 里把 y 加上滑杆偏移再交给系统：每次系统布局写 43.7 都经过这一关，
// 视图最终停在「43.7 + offset」—— 与系统无对抗、稳定、不闪。
// 之前的失败全是因为在 setFrame: **之后**写 transform 去对抗系统写入。
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    // 1.0.8-61 · 动态基准 + 钉死：基准 = 本次横屏会话见过的最小 y（无胶囊时的系统原位）。
    // 滑杆 0 = 系统位置，-20 = 上移 20；权限胶囊出现时系统写的更低 y 不会抬高基准。
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented || !ERLandscapePresentationActive()) {
        static NSMapTable *gERSTUIBaseY = nil;
        static dispatch_once_t onceA;
        dispatch_once(&onceA, ^{ gERSTUIBaseY = [NSMapTable strongToStrongObjectsMapTable]; });
        [gERSTUIBaseY removeObjectForKey:self];
        %orig(frame);
        return;
    }
    if (frame.size.width > 1.0) {
        static NSMapTable *gERSTUIBaseY = nil;
        static dispatch_once_t onceB;
        dispatch_once(&onceB, ^{ gERSTUIBaseY = [NSMapTable strongToStrongObjectsMapTable]; });
        NSNumber *stored = [gERSTUIBaseY objectForKey:self];
        CGFloat baseY = stored.doubleValue;
        if (!stored || frame.origin.y < baseY) {
            baseY = frame.origin.y;
            [gERSTUIBaseY setObject:@(baseY) forKey:self];
        }
        frame.origin.y = baseY + ERLandscapeStatusBarOffset();
    }
    %orig(frame);
}
%end



// 1.0.8-46 · iOS 17.2 横屏 CC 里**用户可见**的那条状态栏（运营商/时间/电量）。
// 它挂在 SBControlCenterWindow 上、不在 overlay 树里；横屏自然位置 y=43。


@interface CCUIStatusLabel : UIView
@end



%hook CCUIStatusBar
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    // 1.0.8-61 · 动态基准 + 钉死（同 STUIStatusBar_Wrapper）
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented || !ERLandscapePresentationActive()) {
        %orig(frame);
        return;
    }
    if (frame.size.width > 1.0) {
        static NSMapTable *gERCCUIBaseY = nil;
        static dispatch_once_t onceC;
        dispatch_once(&onceC, ^{ gERCCUIBaseY = [NSMapTable strongToStrongObjectsMapTable]; });
        NSNumber *stored = [gERCCUIBaseY objectForKey:self];
        CGFloat baseY = stored.doubleValue;
        if (!stored || frame.origin.y < baseY) {
            baseY = frame.origin.y;
            [gERCCUIBaseY setObject:@(baseY) forKey:self];
        }
        frame.origin.y = baseY + ERLandscapeStatusBarOffset();
    }
    %orig(frame);
}
- (void)layoutSubviews {
    %orig;
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented || gERExpandedModuleOpen) return;
    if (!ERLandscapePresentationActive() || gERControlCenterPresentationState == 3) return;
    ERSTUIProbeLog(self, "CCUI-layoutSubviews");
    UIView *target = ERLandscapeStatusChromeTarget(self);
    if (!target) return;
    EchoRebornCoordinator *coordinator = [EchoRebornCoordinator shared];
    CGFloat rise = [coordinator landscapeChromeRiseForContainer:target landscape:YES];
    if (rise > 0.0) {
        [coordinator applyLandscapeRise:rise toView:target];
        // 1.0.8-35 · 登记进 20Hz 重写集合，让"被系统还原后 50ms 内写回"生效。
        // 放在这里（布局回调）而不是 applyLandscapeRise: 内部 —— 后者会被 20Hz 定时器
        // 在**遍历这张表的过程中**调用，在里面改表会抛 mutation 异常。这里不在任何遍历中。
        ERChromeReassertRegisterView(target, rise);
        ERStartLandscapeChromeReassertIfNeeded();
    }
}
%end

%hook CCUIStatusLabel
// 1.0.8-58 · 行内容 label 也钉死：窗口坐标 Y 固定在「原生基准 + 行偏移」。
// 之前容器钉住了、label 却被旧登记的重写拖在别处（winY=67），行就"散架"了。
// 这里同时把外来 transform 归零（那个 ty=-200 来自陈旧登记），再按目标父坐标写 frame。
- (void)setFrame:(CGRect)frame {
    if (gEnabled && gERControlCenterPresented && ERLandscapePresentationActive()
        && frame.size.width > 1.0 && self.window) {
        if (!CGAffineTransformIsIdentity(self.transform)) {
            self.transform = CGAffineTransformIdentity;
        }
        UIView *parent = self.superview;
        CGFloat parentWinY = parent ? [parent convertRect:parent.bounds toView:self.window].origin.y : 0.0;
        frame.origin.y = (kERLandscapeStatusBarNativeY + ERLandscapeStatusBarOffset()) - parentWinY;
    }
    %orig(frame);
}
- (void)layoutSubviews {
    %orig;
    if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented || gERExpandedModuleOpen) return;
    if (!ERLandscapePresentationActive() || gERControlCenterPresentationState == 3) return;
    ERSTUIProbeLog(self, "CCUI-layoutSubviews");
    UIView *target = ERLandscapeStatusChromeTarget(self);
    if (!target) return;
    EchoRebornCoordinator *coordinator = [EchoRebornCoordinator shared];
    CGFloat rise = [coordinator landscapeChromeRiseForContainer:target landscape:YES];
    if (rise > 0.0) {
        [coordinator applyLandscapeRise:rise toView:target];
        // 1.0.8-35 · 登记进 20Hz 重写集合，让"被系统还原后 50ms 内写回"生效。
        // 放在这里（布局回调）而不是 applyLandscapeRise: 内部 —— 后者会被 20Hz 定时器
        // 在**遍历这张表的过程中**调用，在里面改表会抛 mutation 异常。这里不在任何遍历中。
        ERChromeReassertRegisterView(target, rise);
        ERStartLandscapeChromeReassertIfNeeded();
    }
}
%end

%ctor {
    // 1.0.9-68 · 诊断：确认这个 %ctor 是否被执行（之前合并进去的初始化日志为 0，需先证明它跑了）
    ERLogInfo(@"ER-CTOR-START ver=1.0.9-103 proc=%@", NSProcessInfo.processInfo.processName ?: @"?");
    // 1.0.9-7 · APPSW-PROBE：iOS 26 开合动画依赖的三个私有类在不在（0/1）。
    // 不在 → 该 hook 组整体跳过（不崩），日志里能一眼看出该往哪个类适配。
    ERStartQuickAccessPositionCorrection();   // 1.0.9-16 · 无条件启动（host 只创建一次，不能只依赖安装路径）
    ERLogInfo(@"APPSW-PROBE ver=1.0.9-103 zoom=%d crossfade=%d snapshot=%d",
              objc_getClass("SBFullscreenZoomView") != nil,
              objc_getClass("SBCrossfadeView") != nil,
              objc_getClass("SBReusableSnapshotItemContainer") != nil);

    // 1.0.9-11 · **QABTN-PROBE 独立定时器版**：前三版零命中，因为探针被放在了「只在按钮创建时执行」
    // 的代码里（那一刻横屏判定还没就绪）。改成独立定时器：每 1.5 秒自寻快捷按钮 host（tag 181000），
    // 打印 host / 按钮中心 / overlay 面板三者的窗口 Y —— 一组数据就能确定是哪一层在动。
    dispatch_source_t qaBtnProbeTimer = dispatch_source_create(DISPATCH_SOURCE_TYPE_TIMER, 0, 0, dispatch_get_main_queue());
    if (qaBtnProbeTimer) {
        dispatch_source_set_timer(qaBtnProbeTimer,
                                  dispatch_time(DISPATCH_TIME_NOW, (int64_t)(3.0 * NSEC_PER_SEC)),
                                  (uint64_t)(1.5 * NSEC_PER_SEC),
                                  (uint64_t)(0.3 * NSEC_PER_SEC));
        dispatch_source_set_event_handler(qaBtnProbeTimer, ^{
            @try {
                if (!gEnabled || !gERControlCenterPresented) return;
                for (UIWindow *probeWindow in ERAllApplicationWindows()) {
                    UIView *qaHost = [probeWindow viewWithTag:181000];
                    if (!qaHost) continue;
                    CGFloat hostWinY = [qaHost convertRect:qaHost.bounds toView:probeWindow].origin.y;
                    CGFloat btnCenterWinY = -1.0;
                    for (UIView *sub in qaHost.subviews) {
                        if (![sub isKindOfClass:[UIButton class]]) continue;
                        btnCenterWinY = [sub.superview convertPoint:sub.center toView:probeWindow].y;
                        break;
                    }
                    CGFloat overlayWinY = -1.0;
                    for (UIViewController *overlayController in gOverlayControllers.allObjects) {
                        if (overlayController.view.window) {
                            overlayWinY = [overlayController.view convertRect:overlayController.view.bounds
                                                                       toView:overlayController.view.window].origin.y;
                        }
                        break;
                    }
                    ERLogInfo(@"QABTN-PROBE hostWinY=%.1f btnCenterWinY=%.1f overlayWinY=%.1f landscape=%d drop=%.1f win=%@",
                              hostWinY, btnCenterWinY, overlayWinY,
                              (int)ERLandscapePresentationActive(), kERLandscapeCornerButtonDrop,
                              NSStringFromClass(probeWindow.class));
                    break;
                }
            } @catch (__unused NSException *exception) {}
        });
        dispatch_resume(qaBtnProbeTimer);
    }
    @autoreleasepool {
        // 必须在 ERLoadPrefs() 之前：那里会读 COSMICDuplicateFamilies。
        ERMigrateRenamedPreferenceState();
        ERLoadPrefs();
        // Master switch — the definitive, future-proof disable. With EchoReborn
        // off we install no hooks, register no observers, and allocate nothing,
        // so SpringBoard behaves exactly as if the tweak were not present. Every
        // current and future feature is covered automatically because nothing
        // below this line runs. (Toggling the master switch needs a respring to
        // fully take effect, since hooks can't be uninstalled live.)
        if (!gEnabled) {
            ERLogRecord(@"WARN", @"ctor: EchoReborn disabled, no hooks installed");
            return;
        }
        // The package intentionally has no firmware ceiling so it installs on
        // anything from iOS 16 up.  iOS 18, however, rebuilt Control Center on
        // a different module-grid architecture; EchoReborn disables itself there
        // at runtime instead of half-hooking a surface it does not understand.
        if (ERSystemVersionAtLeast(18.0)) {
            ERLogRecord(@"WARN", [NSString stringWithFormat:@"ctor: iOS %.1f detected, EchoReborn inactive", ERSystemVersion()]);
            return;
        }
        if (!ERControlCenterClusterAvailable()) {
            ERLogRecord(@"ERROR", @"ctor: ControlCenterUIKit cluster missing, EchoReborn inactive");
            return;
        }
        %init(_ungrouped);
        ERLogRecord(@"INFO", [NSString stringWithFormat:@"ctor: hooks installed on iOS %.1f", ERSystemVersion()]);
        // 0.4.0: liquid glass is vendored, not delegated. Register the Control
        // Center material host so the ported MTMaterialView router glasses
        // native module platters / sliders; converted connectivity tiles are
        // glassed directly in EREnsureConnectivityTileMaterial. Enable state
        // lives in the shared prefs domain (Global.Enabled / ControlCenter.
        // Enabled) and reloads live through GlassKit's Darwin observer.
        ERGlassRegisterControlCenterHost();
        // Nothing is swizzled for the slider readout. Previous builds
        // enumerated the class list here and installed a -layoutSubviews
        // trampoline; because that trampoline resolved its original by walking
        // the class hierarchy, and another installed tweak interposes
        // class_getSuperclass, it re-entered itself with a fresh stack frame
        // each time until the stack guard faulted (the long note above the
        // slider section has the full analysis). The readout is now driven by
        // -setValue: hooks on the slider classes plus EchoReborn's own pan
        // recogniser, so there is deliberately no installer here.
        gOverlayControllers = [NSHashTable weakObjectsHashTable];
        gERNativeLayoutRects = [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        gERBaseLayoutSizes = [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        gERConnectivityOptimisticStates = [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        CFPropertyListRef savedOrigins = CFPreferencesCopyAppValue(CFSTR("ModuleGridOrigins"), kERPrefsDomain);
        gERCustomOrigins = [(__bridge NSDictionary *)savedOrigins mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        if (savedOrigins) CFRelease(savedOrigins);
        CFPropertyListRef savedLandscapeOrigins = CFPreferencesCopyAppValue(CFSTR("COSMICLandscapeOrigins"), kERPrefsDomain);
        gERLandscapeOrigins = [(__bridge NSDictionary *)savedLandscapeOrigins mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];

        // 1.0.9-42 · **一次性修复「模块散落到不同页」**
        //
        // 起因：1.0.9-39 的空白落点写入把"绝对行 9"这类值写进了存储。由于每页 8 行，
        // 该值在横屏落在第 2 页、在竖屏也按绝对行解释 → 模块跑到第 2 页（有些又回到第 1 页）。
        //
        // 这里做一次性的格位清空，让所有模块回到默认排布；用偏好标记保证只执行一次。
        if (!ERPreferenceBool(@"LayoutReset42", NO)) {
            [gERCustomOrigins removeAllObjects];
            [gERLandscapeOrigins removeAllObjects];
            CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("ModuleGridOrigins"),
                                     (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)[gERCustomOrigins copy], kERPrefsDomain);
            CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("COSMICLandscapeOrigins"),
                                     (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)[gERLandscapeOrigins copy], kERPrefsDomain);
            CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("LayoutReset42"), (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)@YES, kERPrefsDomain);
            CFPreferencesAppSynchronize(kERPrefsDomain);
            ERLogInfo(@"LAYOUT-RESET 已清空自定义格位（修复模块错页）");
        }
        if (savedLandscapeOrigins) CFRelease(savedLandscapeOrigins);
        CFPropertyListRef savedSizes = CFPreferencesCopyAppValue(CFSTR("ModuleGridSizes"), kERPrefsDomain);
        gERCustomSizes = [(__bridge NSDictionary *)savedSizes mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        if (savedSizes) CFRelease(savedSizes);
        CFPropertyListRef savedDuplicates = CFPreferencesCopyAppValue(CFSTR("COSMICDuplicateFamilies"), kERPrefsDomain);
        gERDuplicateFamilies = [(__bridge NSDictionary *)savedDuplicates mutableCopy] ?: [NSMutableDictionary dictionary];
        if (savedDuplicates) CFRelease(savedDuplicates);
        // 1.0.5：三份账本里若还有 CCAster 时期的键，统一归一化到当前前缀。
        // 归一化只动键、不动值，幂等；它保证「哪些磁贴归插件管」这件事永远只认一套标识，
        // 也让迁移的并集合并不会留下成对的新旧前缀条目。
        ERNormalizeIdentifierKeys(gERDuplicateFamilies);
        ERNormalizeIdentifierKeys(gERCustomOrigins);
        ERNormalizeIdentifierKeys(gERLandscapeOrigins);
        ERNormalizeIdentifierKeys(gERCustomSizes);
        // 1.0.6：归一化只保证「键与值的前缀一致」，不保证值存在。历史上落盘过
        // 「有键、值为空串」的条目，而空值条目既渲染不出来、又把对应控制项挡在
        // 「添加控制项」之外 —— 这就是「快捷指令不显示，怎么弄都不回来」。
        // 在这里（读盘之后、任何使用之前）一次性补成合法值。
        ERRepairDuplicateLedger();
        // 0.5.5.0：旧的 uuid 磁贴（shortcut.<uuid>）已被真实槽位模块（shortcut.N）
        // 取代。这里残留的 uuid 键会生出一块没有 bundle 的孤儿自绘磁贴，一律丢掉。
        {
            NSMutableArray<NSString *> *legacy = [NSMutableArray array];
            for (NSString *identifier in gERDuplicateFamilies) {
                if (![identifier isKindOfClass:[NSString class]]) continue;
                if (!ERShortcutIdentifierIsShortcut(identifier)) continue;
                if (ERShortcutSlotIndexFromIdentifier(identifier) != 0) continue;
                [legacy addObject:identifier];
            }
            if (legacy.count) {
                for (NSString *identifier in legacy) {
                    [gERDuplicateFamilies removeObjectForKey:identifier];
                    [gERCustomOrigins removeObjectForKey:identifier];
                }
                CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("COSMICDuplicateFamilies"), (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)[gERDuplicateFamilies copy], kERPrefsDomain);
                CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("ModuleGridOrigins"), (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)[gERCustomOrigins copy], kERPrefsDomain);
                CFPreferencesAppSynchronize(kERPrefsDomain);
                ERLogInfo(@"shortcuts: dropped %lu legacy uuid tile(s) in favour of slot modules", (unsigned long)legacy.count);
            }
        }
        // Connectivity is fixed at Apple's native 2x2 size. Remove builds'
        // stale 4x2 override without disturbing the user's chosen grid origin.
        if (gERCustomSizes[@"com.apple.control-center.ConnectivityModule"]) {
            [gERCustomSizes removeObjectForKey:@"com.apple.control-center.ConnectivityModule"];
            CFPreferencesSetAppValue(CFSTR("ModuleGridSizes"), (__bridge CFPropertyListRef)[gERCustomSizes copy], kERPrefsDomain);
            CFPreferencesAppSynchronize(kERPrefsDomain);
        }
        CFNotificationCenterAddObserver(CFNotificationCenterGetDarwinNotifyCenter(), NULL, ERPrefsChanged, (__bridge CFStringRef)kERReloadNotification, NULL, CFNotificationSuspensionBehaviorDeliverImmediately);
        // 1.0.7-11：相机双摄的全部信号（名称本身区分状态，见 ERDualCamHeartbeat 注释）。
        for (NSString *signal in @[@"com.strive.echoreborn/dualcam.heartbeat",
                                   @"com.strive.echoreborn/dualcam.state.off",
                                   @"com.strive.echoreborn/dualcam.state.notopbar",
                                   @"com.strive.echoreborn/dualcam.state.installed"]) {
            CFNotificationCenterAddObserver(CFNotificationCenterGetDarwinNotifyCenter(), NULL, ERDualCamHeartbeat, (__bridge CFStringRef)signal, NULL, CFNotificationSuspensionBehaviorDeliverImmediately);
        }
        // Lets the Settings pane force a Shortcuts re-scan on the SpringBoard
        // side; the pane itself has no access to the Shortcuts store.
        CFNotificationCenterAddObserver(CFNotificationCenterGetDarwinNotifyCenter(), NULL, ERShortcutRescanRequested, (__bridge CFStringRef)kERShortcutRescanNotification, NULL, CFNotificationSuspensionBehaviorDeliverImmediately);
        // 槽位 bundle 点击 -> 广播 RunShortcut；本进程读 ShortcutRunRequest 并按
        // 标识符运行工作流（不前台化快捷指令 App）。
        CFNotificationCenterAddObserver(CFNotificationCenterGetDarwinNotifyCenter(), NULL, ERShortcutRunRequested, (__bridge CFStringRef)kERShortcutRunNotification, NULL, CFNotificationSuspensionBehaviorDeliverImmediately);
        Class overlayClass = NSClassFromString(@"CCUIModularControlCenterOverlayViewController");
        SEL willOpen = NSSelectorFromString(@"moduleCollectionViewController:willOpenExpandedModule:");
        SEL didClose = NSSelectorFromString(@"moduleCollectionViewController:didCloseExpandedModule:");
        Class controlCenterClass = NSClassFromString(@"SBControlCenterController");
        SEL presentationStateChanged = NSSelectorFromString(@"controlCenterViewController:didChangePresentationState:");
        if (controlCenterClass && class_getInstanceMethod(controlCenterClass, presentationStateChanged)) {
            %init(ERPresentationStateCallbacks);
        }
        if (overlayClass && class_getInstanceMethod(overlayClass, willOpen) && class_getInstanceMethod(overlayClass, didClose)) {
            %init(ERExpandedModuleCallbacks);
        }
        Class collectionClass = NSClassFromString(@"CCUIModuleCollectionViewController");
        SEL collectionWillClose = NSSelectorFromString(@"contentModuleContainerViewController:willCloseExpandedModule:");
        if (collectionClass && class_getInstanceMethod(collectionClass, collectionWillClose)) {
            %init(ERExpandedModuleWillCloseCallback);
        }
        Class detailPresentationClass = NSClassFromString(@"CCUIContentModuleDetailPresentationController");
        if (detailPresentationClass && class_getInstanceMethod(detailPresentationClass, @selector(containerViewWillLayoutSubviews))) {
            %init(ERExpandedPlatterRadius);
        }
        Class clickAssistantClass = NSClassFromString(@"_UIClickPresentationAssistant");
        SEL dismissalSelector = NSSelectorFromString(@"_animateDismissalIsInterruption:");
        if (clickAssistantClass && class_getInstanceMethod(clickAssistantClass, dismissalSelector)) {
            %init(ERExpandedModuleClickAssistant);
        }
    }


}
